<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">Samuel Niina</book>
  <para style="h">Samuel Niina</para>
  <para style="toc1">Samuel Niina</para>
  <para style="toc2">Samuel Niina</para>
  <para style="mt">Samuel Niina</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul ii thi zawkciang, David sia Amalek te a zawna pan hong cia a, Ziklag ah ni nii taam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A zing ciangin khangno khat Saul ii ngiaphual panin hong theng hi. Ama khuangaina a lak natu in a puante eaukeak in a lu tungah leivui kipoai hi. Ama in David kungah pai in, zatak piakna in lei ah bok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in, “Koisung pan hong pai ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Ama in, “Israel te ngiaphual panin hong suakta khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Bang thu teng piang ziam hong son ta'n,” David in ci hi. “Ih ngalkaphonpi ngalphual panin taikeak hi, tuaciang ih mite tam ma kithatlum hi. Saul le a tapa Jonathan zongh kithat hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Bangbangin Saul le Jonathan thi hunlam he ni ziam?” ci in David in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in, “Kei Gilboa Mualvum tungah ka om luilam a, Saul sia a tei neal in om hi, tuaciang siphu ngalleang le siphu ngalkapte in ama a neak vaial ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuasia ciang ama hong kiheak a, kei hong mu in hong sam hi. ‘Topa!’ ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in akua ni ziam ci in hong dongh a, Amalek te ka hi hi, ci in ka son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia ciang ama in, ‘Hong pai ta'n a, hong that ta'n! Kei ka liamna nasia a, a thi tu hi zo khi hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama kung ka zuan a, ka that hi, banghang ziam cile ama puksuk pole a thi tu veve ahi sia ka he hi. Tua zawkciang, ama lu pan a kumpilukhu le a baan pan a haak la in, nangma hong puak khi hi, topa awng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David khuangai in a puan eaukeak a, a mite theampo tuabang ma in ngamta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saul le Jonathan, tuaciang Israel te Topa ii mite ngalphual ah tam mama kithat ahikom, amate hee in mau in, nitak dong an tang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thu hong puak khangno pa munah, “Nang koisung pan ni ziam?” ci in David in dongh hi. Ama in, “Kei Amalek te ka hi a, ahizong nangma ngam sungah ka teang hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David in, “Banghangin Topa ii tealsa kumpipa that ngam ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciang, David in a mite khat sam a, “Hi sia pa that in!” ci in sawl hi. Tua pa in Amalek pa vaat vawk a, nasia liam mama hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuaciang David in Amalek pa tungah, “Hi sia nangma kivawt hi. Topa ii a teal kumpipa khat ka thatlum na ci hu in nangma le nangma kipuavawk ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in Saul le a tapa Jonathan atu hi kaa la sa a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuasia Judah mite tungah hil sawn tu in thupia hi. (Tuasia Jashar Thubu sungah kikhum hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Israel mualte tungah ih lampuite thi hi! Ih ngalkap hangbel teng thi zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasia Gath ah taangko heak vun, Ashkelon lampite ah zongh taangko heak vun. Philistia numeite lungdamsak bua tawng; doai biate ii tanute lungdamsak bua tawng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Gilboa mualte tungah nguatui le daaitui kia heak hen; a lote kolh tawntung tahen! Banghang ziam cile tua munah a hangsan te ii lum teng mindaina taw liik a; Saul ii lum sia sathau taw kizut nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jonathan ii thal sia thi theina hi a, Saul ii namsau in hesuakna selin, a thahat te vaat vawk a, ngalte thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Saul le Jonathan, lamdangin ithuai a, a nunna ah nungta khawm, a thina ah thi khawm hi; muvanlaite sangin zuan ngang zaw, tawpi te sangin hat zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Israel numeite awng, Saul atu khuangai vun! ama in puansan hoite nang hong silhsak a, suang manphate le khamh taw hong zeam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ngalkap hangte puk zo a, amate ngalphual ah kithatlum uh hi. Jonathan sia mual tungah thi in lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nang atu in hee khi hi, ka suapui Jonathan awng; bangza in kei atu in ithuai ni ziam! Kei nong itna bangza in lamdang ziam, Numeite ii itna sang zongin nasia zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ngalkap hangte puk siat zo a, a ngalhiamte kimanna selin kinusia hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia zawkciang David in Topa dongh a, “Keima pai in Judah khuate khat ka uk tu ziam?” ci hi. “Uk in,” ci in Topa in zo hi. David in “Koisia ziam?” ci in, dongh hi. Topa in, “Hebron” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom David in Hebron ah a zite nii ahi Jezreel pan Ahinoam le Carmel pan Nabal ii zi meingongnu Abigail te kengin pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a mite le tuate ii innkuanpuite zongh paipui a, Hebron kiim a khuate ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Judah pan a mite Hebron ah hong pai in David sia Judah kumpipa tu in sathau noai uh hi. Gilead ngamsung Jabesh mite in Saul luang a phum sia David in a zaak ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tualai ah mihing pawlkhat paisak a, kam vaitha hi: “Na kumpipa tungah a luang na vuina taw thumaanna na lak uh a, na lak uh hu in Topa in thupha hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu in Topa dikna, a thumaanna no tungah hong tung tahen. Noma nasepna sa te hangin kei zongh no hong phatvawt tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hat vun a, hang vun! Noma kumpipa Saul thi zo a, Judah mite in kei sia a kumpipa ci in sathau hong noai zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saul ii ngalkaphonpi ukpa Ner ii tapa Abner sia Saul ii tapa Ishbosheth taw Jordan ngun kaantan in Mahanaim ah tai khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua sungah Abner in Ishbosheth sia Gilead, Asher, Jezreel, Ephraim le Benjamin ngam teng ii kumpipa in koi a, a tatakin Israel ngam buppi uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in a kikoi hun in, ama sia kum 40 pha a, kum nii sung uk hi. Ahihang Judah nam in David tungah thumaan ahiciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ama in Hebron panin Judah te kum sali le kum lang sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abner le Ishbosheth ii uliante Mahanaim pan Gibeon khuapi ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zeruiah ii tapa Joab le David ii ulian dangte sia amate taw tuicing khat hui ah kisii uh hi, tua munah amate teng, pawlkhat sia tuicing ii langkhat ah, pawldang khat sia tuicing ii a langkhat ah to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abner in Joab munah, “Eima sang tek panin khangnote pawlkhat veve sawlin kido kidemsak tawng,” ci hi. Joab in, “Hi hen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom Ishbosheth le Benjamin namte taangin mihing sawm le nii, le David mihing sawm le nii te kidosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Misim in a kido pui tek sia a lu pan kizamh in, namsau taw a pangh tek kihol uh ahiciang mihing 24 sia pukin thi siat uh hi. Tua ahikom Gibeon ah tua mun sia, “Namsaute Lo” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kidona nasia mama khat hong nei in, David mite in Abner le Israel te zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zeruiah ii tapate thum tua sungah kihel hi: Joab, Abishai, le Asahel ahi uh hi. Asahel sia ngamsa, sangai bangin a tai ngang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abner del tan pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abner in nung lee et kik a, “Nangma Asahel ni ziam?” ci hi. Ama in, “Hi khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abner in, “Kei hong del heak in! Ngalkapte khat del in a, a nei po laaksak in,” ci hi. Ahihang Asahel in ama del tan lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khatvei ma Abner in, “Hong del heak in! Banghang nang hong thatlumsak hamtang tu ni ziam? Tuabang hi leng bangbangin na suapui pa Joab mai mu ngam tu khi ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang Asahel a tawlnga nuam bua hi; tua ahikom Abner in a tei taw a nungsang a khaw le Asahel ngil kha in a nungah pailet hi. Asahel lei ah topsuk in thi hi, tuaciang tuak a luang sialna munah hong pai peuma in tawlnga in en uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang Joab le Abishai in Abner ii nung zuizenin, nitum ciangin Giah ngam nisuana sang, Gibeon duisung paina lampi tung, Ammah mual theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Benjamin nam pan pasalte Abner ii kiim ah kikhawmtua kikin mualdawn khat tungah ngalnanna mun la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Abner in Joab oksan a, “Tawp hun nei ngawlin kido tan tu hi ziam? A khakbel ciang thin lalna simngawl bangma dang taang nawn ngawl tu ci in mu thei ngawl nu ziam? Ko sia na ngammipuite khu hi. Na mite munah ko hong del a tawp natu thu na piak tu, bang tanvei hai tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joab in, “Pau ngawl hi thong lete ka mite in zingsang khuavak dong hong del tu hi, ci in a nungta Pathian taw kiciam ngam khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Joab in Israel te a del a mi teng a tawlngak natu in lemle tum hi; tuabangin kidona tawp uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abner le a mite sia Jordan Kuam dungah zankhua in pai uh hi; amate Jordan ngun kaantan in, a zingsang kik hunsung bup a pai suak zawkciang, Mahanaim theng kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Joab in ngal del a tawp zawkciang a mi teng a khoptua le, Asahel kihel in a kingawm mihing sawm le kua kisamh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />David ii mite in Benjamin nam Abner ii mite 360 that uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Joab le a mite in Asahel luang phaam in, Bethlehem khua a innkuan ii thaan ah phum uh hi. Tua zawkciang zankhua in pai a, zingsang khuavak bek in Hebron theng kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul ii bangkua sang a pangte le David ii bangkua sang a pangte ii kidona sia khuangei hi. David hong hat vaial ciang, ama a langpante hong thazawm vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David ii tapa luk Hebron ah a suak teng sia a piankum zui in: Amnon, a nu sia Jezreel panin Ahinoam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chileab, a nu sia Carmel panin Nabal ii zi meingong nu Abigail; Absalom, a nu sia Geshur kumpipa Talmai ii tanu Maacah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Adonijah, a nu sia Haggith; Shephatiah, a nu sia Abital;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ithream, a nu sia Eglah hi. Hi tapate theampo sia Hebron ah piang siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David ii ngalkapte le Saul ii bangkua tung a thumaan ngalkapte a kido tawto uh ciang, Saul ii nungzuite sung pan Abner hong thahat vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni khat ni in Saul ii tapa Ishbosheth in Abner sia Saul ii zino Aiah ii tanu Rizpah taw lumkhawm hi ci in mawsuanh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hisia in Abner thinsosak hi. “Saul leeheak tu in hong um ni ziam? Judah te atu na a seseam hong sa takpi ni ziam?” ci ngawp hi. “A kipat peuma pan na pa Saul, a suapuite le a ngualtamhte tungah thumaan khi hi, tuaciang David ii hong zaw natu pan hong hun khi hi; ahitazong tuni in numei khat huvau in maw hong zong ni hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in David munah kamciam pia a, ama in kumpi ngam sia Saul le a suan a paalte tung pan la in, David sia ngam mong khat pan mong khat dong a uk Israel le Judah kumpipa suaksak tu hi. Tu in hi thu ka taangtungsak buale Pathian in hong saatlum tahen!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ishbosheth in Abner kiita mama ahikom kam khat zongh pau ngam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abner in tua laitak Hebron ah a om David kungah kamtaite paisak a, “Akua in hi ngam hi lei uk tu ziam? Keima taw thukimna khat hong vawt ta'n, tuaciang Israel ngam bup nangma sangah na nga natu kong hu tu hi,” cisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in, “Pha hi! nang taw thukimna vawt tu khi hi, ahihang nong hisak tu khat sia: kei taw kimu tu nong pai ciang Saul ii tanu Michal hong keng nanak tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David in Ishbosheth tung zongh ah kam thaak a, “Ka zi Michal hong pia kik ta'n, ama ka teenpui natu in Philistine te ii vunteap zakhat taw ka tat sa hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom Ishboseth in Michal sia Laish ii tapa, a pasal Paltiel kung panin la khe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Paltiel in lam tawntung ma in kap kawmin Bahurim khua dong zui hi. Ahihang Abner in, “Inn ah ciakik ta'n,” a ci ciang ama cia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abner sia Israel lampuite kungah pai in, “Khua ngeipi ma David sia na kumpipa tu in dei nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu in hisia no atu hunpha hi. Topa in hi bang a ci sia ciamtee vun, ‘Ka naseampa David in, Israel ka mite sia Philistine te le ngal a dangte theampo panin a suatak natu in zangh tu khi hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abner in Benjamin nam pan mite tung zongh ah a son zawkciang Benjamin mite le Israel te ii a vawt tu thukimna teng David munah a son tu in Hebron ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hebron khua David kungah mihing kul taw Abner hong pai ciangin David in amate atu poai vawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abner in David munah, “Tu in ka na pai tu a, Israel buppi kumpipa nangma sangah kong pangsak tu hi. Amate in nang sia kumpipa in hong saang tu hi, tuaciangin nangma in na dei teng na nga siat tu a, ngam buppi na uk tu hi” ci hi. David in Abner sia ngammuan natu thukho khat pia in paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A zawkciang, Joab le David ii ulian dangte ngalsimna panin a sutol uh vanh tam mama taw hong cia hi. Abner ahile tua mun Hebron ah David taw a om nawn bua hi, banghang ziam cile David in ama sia ngammuanna thukho taw thaa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joab le a mite hong thet uh ciangin ama tungah Abner sia David kumpipa kungah haw zo a, ngammuan natu kamciam pia in a kipaisakna thu kison hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahikom Joab sia kumpipa kungah pai in, “Bang vawt thong ni ziam? Abner nang kungah hong pai ci leang — banghangin thaa thong ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama hi sungah hong pai sia nang hong theam tu, na sep na vawt theampo le na paina theampo a kan tu in hong pai hi. Tuasia na heak ma hi ngawl ziam!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Joab in David a nusiat zawkciang Abner sam tu in kamtaite paisak a, tuaciang amate in Sirah tuikhuk panin ama hong ciapui kik hi; ahihang David in bangma heak pui ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hebron ah Abner hong thet ciangin, Joab in ama nguak taw thu son tubangin kongpi ah a tuamin paipui a, tua munah a ngil pan naam taw hol hi. Tuabangin Abner sia kisuamlum hi, banghang ziam cile ama in Joab ii suapuipa Asahel thalupsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />David in tua thu a zaak ciang, “ Topa in kei le ka uk sung mite Abner kisuamlupna tungtaang ah bekcik zongh maw ngawl hi ci in hong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua atu in daan piakna Joab le a innkuan bup in thuak tahen! Khangsimin a bangkua sungah numei le pa omkhopna pan a piang natna a vei khat, ahibuale a lauhuai vun natna khat, ahibuale numei nasep teng a seam thei bek khat, tua ahibuale ngal sungah a thi khat, ahibuale an neak tu nei ngawl khat veu om vaciat tahen!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuabangin Joab le a suapuipa Abishai in Gibeon kidona ah amate ii suapuipa Asahel a thatlum pa Abner tungah phulam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David in Joab le a mite a puan uh eaukeak in, khau-ip puan silh a, Abner thina hangin a khuangai natu in thupia hi. Tuaciang thi vuina ah Kumpipa David mama mithi kuang nung pan zui in pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Abner sia Hebron ah kiphumin, kumpipa sia a thaan ah a ngingin kap a, mite theampo zongh kap tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />David in hi kaa la Abner sak hi: “Banghangin Abner sia a mawmaw pa bangin thi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A khut te kiletheen ngawl hi, a peangte kisawm ngawl hi; Ama sia khialna lian vawtte ii thalup mi khat bangin thi hi!” Tuaciang mipite in ama kaa kik leleau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mipite nitangtum hanciamin David in bang khat po nesak nuam ahihang ama in a ciliap huai kamciam vawt a, “Nitum ma in neak khat po ka nei le Pathian in hong vaatlum tahen!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate in hisia ciamtee a, lungkim mama uh hi. A tatakin, David ii vawt theampo in mipite lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />David ii a mi teng le Israel mi theampo in Abner kisuamlupna ah kumpipa a kihel ngawlna thu tel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kumpipa in a uliante munah, “Tuni in Israel ngam sungah lampui lian khat thi ahi hunlam phawk ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Keima sia Pathian ii teal kumpipa ka hisaap hang, tuni in ka tha zawm hi. Hi Zeruiah ii tapate sia kei atu in ngoltol lei hi. Hi khialna lian vawtte a kilawm bangin Topa in daan pia tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hebron khua ah Abner kisuamlupna thu, Saul ii tapa Ishbosheth in a zaak ciang lau mama a, Israel mite theampo patau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ishbosheth in ulian nii nei a, ngalsim lampuite veu ahi hi, amate Benjamin nam, Beeroth khua pan Rimmon ii tapate hi a, Baanah le Rechab ahi uh hi. (Beeroth sia Benjamin ngam in kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A teangciil te sia Gittaim ah a tai pan kipan tua munah teang uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saul ii suan le paal dang khat sia Jonathan ii tapa Mephibosheth hi a, kum nga a phak laitakin Saul le Jonathan ngal sungah kithat hi. Jezreel khuapi panin amate ii thina a kizaak ciang, ama a omh nu in zamh a taipui hi; ahihang ama manlang nuam mama ahikom a nau taaksua tha a, a peangbai khat suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rechab le Baanah te Ishbosheth inn ah a haw tu in hong pai in, sun hun ama ii tawlngak laitakin tualai ah theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Numei kongkhacing sia zungtaang kheapin a omna ah lusu in mu zo hi, tua ahikom Rechab le Baanah te tum ku uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate inn sung hong thet poma ciang Ishbosheth ii lupna inndoi sungah tum in, ama mutthip in om sia thatlum hi. Tua zawkciang a lu tansak a, Jordan Kuam zui in zankhua paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in a lutang sia Hebron ah David pia a, “Nang hong that tu a hanciam na ngalpa Saul ii tapa Ishbosheth lutang hi sungah om hi. Tuni in Topa in kumpipa nang sia Saul le a suan a paal te tungah phulaak tu hong oai hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in, “Launa theampo pan hong hun a nungta Topa taw ka kiciam hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kamtaipa sia kei kung Ziglag ah hong pai a, Saul ii thina sia lungdamhuai thu sa in kei hong son hi. Ama man in thatsak khi hi. Ama hong puak lungdamhuai thu hu a, tel ka piak sia tuabang hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mawnei ngawl, ama inn sungah a mu mihing khat a suamlum mi ngilote atu in bangza in sia zaw lai tu ziam! Tu in ama na suamlup uh hu in a phulamsak tu khi hi, tuaciang no sia lei maitang panin hong zutmaai tu khi hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David in thupia a, a ngalkapte in Rechab le Baanah te thatlum in, a khutte a peangte a tansak zawk uh ciang, Hebron tuicing hui ah khai uh hi. Amate in Ishbosheth lutang la in Hebron khua Abner ii thaankuul ah phum uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel namte theampo Hebron khua David kungah hong pai in ama munah, “Ko sia nangma ii chi le sa hi khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A bosa hun sung Saul sia ih kumpipa ahi lai ngawngawn in, nangma in Israel mite ngal kidona sungah na lampui a, tuaciang Topa in na mite na lampui natu le a ukpa na sua natu kamciam hong pia hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuabangin Israel lampui theampo David Kumpipa kung Hebron ah hong pai uh hi. Ama in amate taw a thiangtho kipawlpuina vawt a, amate in ama sathau noai in, Israel kumpipa suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David sia kumpipa a sua hunin kum 30 pha a, kum 40 sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Hebron panin Judah te kum sali le lang sung uk a, Jerusalem panin Israel le Judah te theampo kum 33 sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa David le a mite ii Jerusalem sim tu in a kuan tu hun hong theng hi. Tua munah a teang Jebus te in tua khuapi sia David in zothal zo tu in um ngawl ahikom ama tung ah, “Hi lai ah nang hong tum ngeingawl tu ni hi; mittawte le peangbaite ngawngawn in hong nolh keak zo tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />(Ahihang David in amate Zion kulhpi suan takpi in tua hun pan kipan “David Khuapi” kici hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ni in David in, a mite tungah, “Jebus mite kei ii ngaimawk za in a ngaimaw hi sungah na om uh ziam? Thalup nop dongin a ensan na om uh ziam? Tua ahile tui laakna lei tawlet sia zui in pai tavun a, tua a khuangai huai mittaw peangbaite sim tavun,” ci hi. (Tua hu in, “Mittawte le a peangbaite sia Topa inn sungah tum thei ngawl tu hi kici hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kulhpi a suan zawkciang a sungah David teang a, “David khuapi” ci in minvaw hi. Ama in tuasia ii kiimkot ah khuapi sa a, nisuana sang mualpangh ah lei a dipna pan hong pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama thahat vaial tawntung hi, banghang ziam cile Vaanglianbelpa Topa Pathian ama taw omkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tyre khua a om Kumpipa Hiram in David kungah sum zuak sum lei vai taw in taangmi paisak hi; ama in a zak tu in kumpi inn sak natu cedar thingluangte, inn sa thiamte, suang ciang thiamte puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuabangin David in Topa ii ama Israel kumpipa tu in a kipsakna le, a mite atu in a kumpi ngam a khantosakna thu phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hebron pan Jerusalem ah a kikhiin zawk uh ciang David in zinote le zite la thua in tapa tanu a tamzaw lai nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem ah a suak a tate hi bang teng hi: Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ibhar, Elishua, Nepheg, Japhia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elishama, Eliada, le Eliphelet te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Philistine te munah David sia Israel kumpipa kisuaksak zo hi ci in kison ahikom amate ii ngalkaphonpi sia ama man tu in hong kuan uh hi. Hi thu David in a zaak ciangin ngalnanna kulh khat sungah tuaksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Philistine te Rephaim Kuam sung hong theng a tua mun laa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David in Topa dongh a, “Philistine te ka sim tu ziam? Zawna kei nong pia tu ziam?” ci hi. Topa in, “Hi hi, sim in! Zawna kong pia tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahikom David sia Baal Perazim ah kuan a Phillistine te zo hi. Ama in, “ Topa in ka ngalte khuanawl tuipawm bangin nawk keak hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom tua mun sia Baal Perazim kina hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Philistine te a taikeak uh ciang a milimte nusia uh a, tuate David le a mite in laksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Philistine te in Rephaim Kuam ah heak kikin tua mun la kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khatvei ma David in dongh lai a, Topa in, “Hi sung panin sim heak in a, kot pai in, balsam thingkungte omna nai, a pang langkhat sang panin sim tu in kinging vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thingkung dawn teng ah mihon khuasuan nging na zaak uh ciang sim vun, banghang ziam cile Philistine ngalkaphonpi a zo tu in keima noma mai ah a papai hi tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />David in Topa thupiak bangin ngamta a, tuaciang ama in Philistine te Geba pan lam tawntung Gezer dong not kik zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khatvei ma David in Israel ngalkap phabel teng khawmtua a, a vekpi in 30,000 pha uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang ama in amate Judah ngam Baalah ah paipui hi, tuaciang cherub te tungah kumpi in a kitosak, Vaanglianpipa Topa ii min a pu, Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia tua mun panin laak tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in tuasia mualtung a om Abinadab inn pan la in, leangthak khat tungah suan uh hi. Aminadab ii tapate Uzzah le Ahio in khuileang lampui in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />leang mai ah Ahio pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David le Israel buppi sia a tha nei za uh taw Topa patoaina in lasa in laam uh hi. Tengtongh, liamlo, khuang, nguasemh le daalkopsai te tum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate Nacon ii ancilna mun hong thet uh ciangin a khuitalte hong lutu a, Uzzah in Thuciamna Thingkuang hong zamh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua Thuciamna Thingkuang sia a thasia vawt ngawl hu in thakhat thu in Uzzah tungah Topa Pathian thin uuk a, thatlum hi. Uzzah sia Thuciamna Thingkuang hui ah thi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tua ahiciang tua hun pan kipan tua mun sia Perez Uzzah kici hi. David sia a thinso hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in Uzzah sia thin uukna taw daan a piak hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David in Topa kiita a, “Bangbangin Thuciamna Thingkuang sia tu in keima in tonpui ngam nawn tu khi ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in Jerusalem khua ah ciapui ngawl tu in khensat hi; tuasia taangin lampialpui a, Gath khua mi Obed Edom inn ah tun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang sia tua munah tha thum kitaamsak a, Topa in Obed Edom le a bangkua thupha pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa David in Thuciamna Thingkuang hu in, Topa in Obed Edom bangkua le a neisa theampo thupha pia hi ci in za a; tua ahikom ama in Thuciamna Thingkuang sia Obed inn panin la in, poai khaamna lianpi taw Jerusalem ah ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang a pua mihingte kal luk hong suan zawkciang David in tawlngasak a, khuital khat le khuino thau khat sangaw biakpiakna in pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David sia a kawngah dial khat teang bekin, Topa a patoaina in a tha neiza taw laam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabangin ama le Israel mite theampo in Thuciamna Thingkuang Jerusalem ah lawpin auna le lemle aw te taw paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua thingkuang khuapi sung a kithetpui laitakin Saul ii tanu Michal in khelki panin khua a et le David kumpipa Pathian mai ah laamin tawnin a om a mu ciang, hoi maw sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in tua Thingkuang sia David ii tua atu a saksak Puanbuk sungah koi uh hi. Tua zawkciang ama in Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna le kipawlkhop biakpiaknate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sangaw biakpiakna a man zawkciang David in Vaanglianbelpa Topa min taw mipite thupha pia in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />amate an hawmsak hi. Ama in Israel pasal le numei khat simin anluum khat tek, sa em bak khat tek le sapitko tawm tek pia hi. Tua zawkciang a kuama po inn ah cia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David in a innkuanpuite nukset tu in hong cia ciang, Michal sia ama taw kisi tu in hong pusuak hi. “Tuni in Israel kumpipa in ama min let natu khat vawt hi! Ama uliante ii naseam numeite mu na ah a mawmaw bangin kipholaak hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />David in, “Na pa le ama ii bangkua taangin Israel lampui tu in kei hong teal, ka Topa ka patoaina in laam khi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tuaciang tu a sang zongin a nasia zaw lai in keima le keima kisimmawk vawt zaw lai tu khi hi. Nang na hile kei, bangma in hong heang ngawl tha tu ni hi, ahihang tua numeite in kei, hong thupi sim mama tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Saul ii tanu Michal sia a khan sung ta nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa David sia a kumpi inn sungah om a, tuaciang Topa in a ngalte theampo kung panin keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpipa in kamsaang pa Nathan munah, “Kei hi sungah cedar thing taw a kisa inn sungah teang khi hi, ahihang Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia puanbuk sungah kikeam hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nathan in, “Na thinsung a om babangin vawt in, banghang ziam cile nangma taw Topa hong omkhawm hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang tua zanin Topa in Nathan munah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Va pai ta'n a, ka naseampa David munah hi bangin ka ci teng va son ta'n, ‘Kei teen natu biakinn a sa tu sia nang hi ngawl ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Egypt ngam panin ka mite ka suatak hun pan kipan tu hun dong biakinn sungah teang ngeingawl khi hi; puanbuk sungah teangin khualhaw kot khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mite taw ka khualhawna theampo ah a lampui in ka koite khat po tung zongh ah banghangin cedar thing taw a kisa biakinn hong saksak ngawl nu ziam, ci ngeingawl khi hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tua ahikom ka naseampa David munah na son in a, Kei, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, ‘Lo sungah tuu cingin na omna panin nang kong la a, Israel ka mite a uk pa kong suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na paina po ah nang taw kong omkhawm a, maisang na manaw ciang na ngalte theampo ka zo siat hi. Leitung ah lampui lianbel te bangin kong minthangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mi Israel te ten natu mun khat ka teal zo a, tua munah amate kinengniam nawn ngawlin nungta tu uh hi. Ngam hisia sungah amate hong tum pan kipan mihing ngoltolte in sim tawntung ahihang hi bangte piang kik nawn ngawl tu hi. Na ngalte kung pan kong kepcing natu le suan le paal na nei natu in kamciam kong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang thi in na taanghpupite taw na kiphum khop zawkciang zong na tapate sung pan khat kumpipa ka suaksak tu a, a kumpi ngam ka thahatsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama sia biakinn khat kei atu a sa tu pa hi tu a, a kumpi khangngui a tawntungin ka kizomsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in ama ii pa ka hi tu a, ama ka tapa hi tu hi. Sep khial vawt khial a nei ciangin pa ii tapa a daan a piak bangin ka tek tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang nangma kumpipa na sua thei natu in Saul ka huna ka dawkeak bangin tua na tapa sia ka huna ka dawkkeak buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma in suan le paal na nei tawntung tu a, na kumpi ngam ka khomsuansak tu hi. Na kumpi khangngui sia a mong ngei buatu hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian ii a pualaak teng a vekpi in Nathan in David munah son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David kumpipa sia Topa ompuina Puanbuk sung zuan a, to in hi bangin thungen hi: “Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, kei tung ahizong ka innkuanpuite tung ahizong nong septe ka kiphu ka kilawmna uh om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua hi napi tu in a nasia zaw lai in hong seam ni hi, Vaanglianpipa Topa awng; maisang hong pai lai tu kumte ah ka suan ka paalte atu dongin kamciam nong pia zo hi. Tuaciang hisia mihing khat in musak ni hi, Vaanglianpipa awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang tungah bang kong ci lalai thei tu ziam! Kei na naseampa hong he ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi bang nong vawt tu sia nangma deina le tupna hi; nangma in hi na lianpite kei nong hil natu in na vawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangza in lian ni ziam, Vaanglianpipa Topa awng! Nang taw a kibang khat zongh om ngawl hi; nangma bekma Pathian na hi sia kong he tawntung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangma mi tatak a suak tu in na suatak Israel bang peuma leitung ah a dang minam om ngawl hi. Amate atu in na vawt a lian le a lamdang nate in na minthanna leitung buppi kizelsak hi. Egypt ngam pan nangma mi tu in na suataksak na mite maisang a nawk ciangin minam dangte le a pathian te na notkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangma in Israel te a tawntungin nangma mi na suaksak a, Topa awng, tuaciang nangma sia amate ii Pathian suak zo ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tuaciang tu in, Topa Pathian awng, kei le ka suan ka paalte atu kamciam na vawt sia a tawntung atu in hong taangtungsak ta'n, ka seam tu na ci te hong seam ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na minthanna nasia tu a, tuaciang mite in a tawntungin, ‘ Topa Vaanglianbelpa sia Israel ii Pathian hi,’ hong ci tu uh hi. Tuaciang nangma in ka kumpi khangngui sia a tawntung nong kepsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa Vaanglianpipa, Israel ii Pathian awng! Hi thungetna nang tungah hang takin kong ngen ngam hi, banghang ziam cile, nangma in kei na naseampa tungah hi teng nong lak zo a, tuaciang ka suan ka paalte kumpi na suasak tu sia nong son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tuaciang tu in, Vaanglianpipa Topa , nangma in Pathian na hi hi; na kamciamte na len tawntung a, hi a lamdang kamciam sia kei tungah nong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangma piak hamphat nate taw a nopsak tan natu in ka suan ka paalte thupha nong piaksak natu kong ngen hi. Nang, Vaanglianpipa Topa in, hisia nong kamciam zo a, na thupha sia ka suan ka paalte tungah a tawntungin kip tu hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hun tawmvei zawkciang Kumpipa David in Philistine te sim kik in zo ahiciang, amate in a ngam uh uk nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moab te zo hi. A ngal matte lei ah lumsakin thum sung pan nii veu thatlum hi. Tua ahikom Moab te sia a khutnuai mi hong suakin, ama tungah shia pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang, ama in Syria ngamsung Zobah ngamuk kumpipa Rehob ii tapa Hadadezer sia Euphrates ngun naak sangah ngamukna la kik tu in a paina lampi ah ama in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in siphu ngalkap 1,700 le, lei ngalkap 20,000 matsak hi. Ama in siphu ngalleang zakhat atu a kicing khom siphu la in, a dang teng theampo a peangbaisak siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Damascus a om Syria te in Kumpipa Hadadezer hu tu in ngalkaphonpi khat a paisak le David in tuate simin 22,000 that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in amate ngam sungah ngal ngiaphualte saat a, amate sia a khutnuai mite hong suakin, shia pia uh hi. Topa in David sia mun theampo ah ngal zosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hadadezer ii a uliante ii toai khamh lumte David in sut a, Jerusalem ah cia pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Hadadezer ii uk khuapite ahi Betah le Berothai pan taau zongh tam mama la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in Kumpipa Hadadezer ii ngalkaphonpi zo zo hi ci in Hamath kumpipa Toi in za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toi taw tamvei ma a kido ngei Hadadezer sia David in zo ahikom a tapa Joram in muaksak a, tuabangin a lungdampuina ko hi. Joram in David kungah khamh, ngunn le taau taw a kivawt letsongte puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa David in tuate sia a zawthal sa ngamte ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Edom, Moab, Ammon, Philistia, le Amalek te tung pan a laaksak ngunn le khamh te le Hadadezer kung pan a laaksak vanh pawlkhatte taw zong kopin biakna ah a zak tu in koituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ci Kuam sungah Edom mite 18,000 a thalupna pan a cia kik ciang David minthang zawkan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in Edom ngamsung theampo ah ngalkap phualte saat a, tuaciang tua munah a om mite ama ii khutnuai mi suak uh hi. Topa in David mun theampo ah ngal zosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in Israel buppi uk a, a mite thumaan tak le a pha takin a kivawt tawntung natu in uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nu Zeruiah ahi Joab sia ngalkaphonpi a ukpa hi; Ahilud ii tapa Jehoshaphat sia thu tepteena teng a lenpa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahitub ii tapa Zadok le Abiathar ii tapa Ahimelech te sia thiampite ahi hi; Seraiah sia kumpipa zum sung thuzeakpi ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehoiada ii tapa Benaiah sia David a cingte a ukpa hi a, David ii tapate sia thiampite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat ni in David in, “Saul ii bangkua sung pan a nungta lai om ziam? Tuabang a om le Jonathan hu in dikna lak nuam khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul ii innkuan naseampa Ziba a kici khat om a, David kungah ama kipaisak hi. “Nang Ziba ni ziam?” ci in kumpipa in dongh hi. “Na naseampa hi khi hi, topa,” ci in ama in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Pathian tungah kamciamna ka piak bangma, Saul ii bangkua tungah thumaanna le dikna ka lak natu in Saul ii bangkua sungah khat po a kikhe a om ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Ziba in, “Jonathan ii tapa khat om lai hi; Ama a peangbai hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Koi sungah ama om ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Ziba in “Lodebar khua, Ammiel ii tapa Machir inn ah om hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom David kumpipa in ama samsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul ii tupa, Jonathan ii tapa, Mephibosheth a thet ciang David mai ah zatak pia in kun hi. David in, “Mephibosheth awng,” ci in sam a, ama in “Na naseampa hi khi hi, topa,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in, “Lau heak in. Na pa Jonathan hu in nang tungah hong dik tu khi hi. Na pu Saul ii leitang theampo nang kong pia kik tu a, tuaciang nang sia ka sabuai ah an na ne tawntung tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mephibosheth kun kik a, “Kei sia ui thisa khat bang bek hi khi hi, topa awng! Banghangin kei tungah tuaza in hong dik tu ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpipa in Saul ii naseampa Ziba sam a, “Na topa ii tupa Mephibosheth tungah Saul le a bangkua ii neisa theampo pia khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang, na tapate le na naseamte in na topa Saul ii innkuanpuite atu tua leitang tho in, lo an tun ciang amate na puak tu uh hi. Ahihang Mephibosheth ahile keima sabuai ah leangna thupi khat hi tawntung tu hi,” ci hi. (Ziba in tapa sawm le nga le naseam kul nei hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ziba in, “Kumpipa ii nong thupiak babang ka seam tu hi,” ci in zo hi. Tuabangin Mephibosheth in kumpipa ii tapate khat bangin kumpi sabuai ah an ne hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mephibosheth in tapano Mica a kici khat nei hi. Ziba ii innkuanpuite theampo Mephibosheth ii naseamte suak siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom, a peangte ngeal a zaw Mephibosheth sia Jerusalem khua ah teangin, a an neak theampo kumpi sabuai ah ne hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawk tawm vei ciangin Ammon kumpipa Nahash thi a, a tapa Hanun sia kumpi suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa David in, “A pa Nahash ii kei tungah hong vawt bangin Hanun tungah thumaan kilawmtatna ka lak nanak tu hi,” ci hi. Tua hi a, David in a khuangai puina a ko tu in kamtaite paisak hi. Amate Ammon a thet uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammon lampuite in kumpipa tungah, “David in na pa a upatna taw, khuangai puina a lakna in hi mite hong paisak, hi tu in um ni ziam? Hi peuma ngawl hi! Ama in hi sungah amate hong puakna sia ei hong zawthal thei natu in ih khuapi thu a dawp tu ngalvilin hong paisak hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hanun in David ii kamtaite mansak a, a khamul a lang meetkol sakin, a puansilhte a kawng ciangin tansak a, tha kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate inn lam a zot kik tu uh sia maizum leih hi. David in bang thu piang ci a zaak ciang amate tungah kam thaak a, na khamul uh a po kik mateng hong heak kik heak vun a, Jericho khua ah na taam vun ci in zasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in David sia a ngal uh suaksak ci in Ammon te in tel zo ahiciang Bethrehob le Zobah pan Syria ngalkap 20,000, Tob pan 12,000, tuaciang Maacah kumpipa le a mite tulkhat teng ngalcial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in hi thu za a, tuaciang amate do tu in Joab le a ngalkaphonpi bup kuansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ammon te kuanin amate khuapi Rabbah tumna ah mun la uh a, tua laitak a dangte, Syria te le Tob le Maacah pan mite in ngam taanzauna ah mun la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngalte in mai pan le nung panin a sim tu hunlam Joab in mu ahikom Israel ngalkap phabel teng tealin Syria te maingat in mun lasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngalkap a om lai teng sia a suapui pa Abishai in uksak a, Ammon te maingat in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joab in ama munah, “Syria te in kei hong zo tu bangin na mu le hong pai ta'n a hong hu ta'n, tuaciang Ammon te in nang hong zo tu bang ahile keima hong pai in kong hu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hat in a, na thinliansak in! Ih Pathian khuapite le ih mite atu in nasia takin do tawng. Tuaciang Topa ii deina babangin piang tahen!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Joab le a mite in a sim tu mai a nawk ciang, Syria te tai keak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ammon te in Syria te tai a mu uh ciang amate zongh Abishai kung panin tai a, a khuapi sung tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang Joab sia Ammon te a simna pan hong heak kikin Jerusalem khua zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Syria te in Israel te a lel hunlam phawk ahikom a ngalkap theampo khawmtua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa Hadadezer in Euphrates ngun ii nisuana sangah a om Syria te sam a, tuaciang Zobah kumpipa Hadadezer ii ngalkaphonpi ukpa Shobach ukna nuai Helam khua ah amate hong pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in tua thu a zaak ciang Israel ngalkap theampo khawmtua a, Jordan ngun kaantan in Helam ah kuan hi, tua munah Syria te in ama maingat in mun la uh hi. Kidona hong kipan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuaciang Israel te in Syria ngalkaphonpi notkeak kik uh hi. David le a mite in Syria siphu ngalleang ukte 700, siphu ngalkap 40,000 thatin, ngalte ngalkap ukpa Shobach liamsak a, ngalphual ah thi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hadadezer khutnuai a om kumpite in Israel te a lel hunlam a kiphaw uh ciangin ngal kilemna vawtin, amate khutnuai ah om uh hi. Tuaciangin Syria te in Ammon te hu ngam nawn ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipate in ngalsim veu in a kuan hun khaal kipat kik ciangin David in Joab sia a ngalkap bute le ngalkaphonpite taw kuansak hi; amate in Ammon te zo in, Rabbah khuapi uumci uh hi. Ahihang David ama sia Jerusalem ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nikhat, ni kai zawkciang David sia a mutna pan hong tho a, kumpi innkhum tungah kaato hi. Ama tualai ah a vavaa ciang numei khat kibual in a om mu hi. Ama a mealpha mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in kamtaite paisak in, tua nu sia akua ziam ci in a katsak ciang, Hit mi Eliam ii tanu, Uriah ii zi Bathsheba hi ci in he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in ama a sam tu in kamtaite paisak hi; amate in tua nu ama kung then hi, tuaciang ama in luppui hi. (Ama sia tha simin a zeksa kithiansuana a man zawk hiat bek ahi hi.) Tua zawkciang ama cia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A zawkciang ama ngai ahi hunlam kiphawk a, David munah a son tu in kamtai paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia ciang David in Joab tungah kam thaak a: “Hit mi Uriah hong puak ta'n,” cisak hi. Tua ahikom Joab in David kungah ama paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uriah hong thet ciang David in Joab le a ngalkapte a ciidam ziam, ngal kidona bangbang hi ziam ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang, ama in Uriah munah, “Cia in a, tawm vei tawlngak hun la ta'n,” ci hi. Uriah in nusia a, tuaciang David in a inn ah letsong puaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang Uriah cia ngawl a; kumpi inn kongpi ah kumpipa a cingte taw lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uriah sia inn ah a cia ngawl hunlam David in a zaak ciang ama dongh a, “Hun saupi inn taw kikhen a, nong heak kik zawk bek hi ngawl ziam; banghangin cia ngawl ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uriah in, “Israel te le Judah te ngal sungah om a, tuaciang Thuciamna Thingkuang zongh amate taw om hi; kei hong ukpa Joab le a bute zongh mun taanzauna ah ngiaphual saat hi. Bangbangin kei inn zuan a, ne in dawn in ka zi taw lum thei thong tu khi ziam? Tuabang peuma in ngamta ngeingawl tu khi hi ci in biakna taw kisai a thiangtho theampo taw ka kiciam hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom David in, “Tua ahile tuni in hi sungah taam lai in, zing ciangin kong puak kik tu hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Uriah sia tua ni le a zing ciang dong Jerusalem ah taam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in nitak an ne tu in Uriah sam a, zu khamsak hi. Ahihang tua zan zongh Uriah a inn ah cia peang ngawl hi; kumpi inn a cingte inndoi sungah ama puanvan tungah mu zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A zingsang ciang David in Joab lai thaak a, Uriah in a lai puaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in a lai sungah: “Uriah sia ngal kisim a nasia belna, ngal mai ah koi in, tuaciang nungkin vun a, ama thalup thuaksak vun,” ci in at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom Joab in khuapi a uumci laitakin ngalte thahatna munah Uriah puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngalte ngalkapte khuapi panin hong pusuak in, Joab ngalkapte sim uh hi; David ii ngalkapmang pawlkhat kithat a, Uriah zongh thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Joab in David munah ngal kidona thu zasak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuaciang ama in kamtai pa pau natu hil a, “Kumpipa tungah ngal kidona thu teng na son siat zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ama thin uukin, hi bangin hong dongh thei tu hi. ‘Banghangin amate sim tu in khuapi taw a kinai lei na dong pai nu ziam? Khuapi luphungte tung panin thaltangte hong kap tu ci in he ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gideon ii tapa Abimelech a kithalupna ciamtee nawn ngawl nu ziam? A mun sia Thebez hi a, numei khat ii anngoaina suang khat taw luphung tung pan a densuk sia in ama khalum hi. Tua ahile banghangin luphung neak leih in pai nu ziam?’ Kumpipa in tu a bangin hong dongh le ama munah, ‘Na ngalkap mangpa Uriah zongh kithat hi,’ ci vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahikom kamtai pa, David kungah hong pai in Joab ii a thupiak bangin son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in, “Ih ngalte sia ei sangin hat zaw a, mun taanzauna ah ei hong sim tu khuapi sung pan hong pusuak hi, ahihang amate sia khuapi kongpi dong ka nawt kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuasia ciang amate in luphung tung pan thaltang taw hong kap in, na kumpi ngalkapmang pawlkhat hong thalupsak a, Uriah zongh thi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kamtaipa munah David in, “Joab na hanthawn in a, ngal kidona sung sia akua teng thi tu ci in kison thei ngeingawl ahi nungsang a thin lal ngawl natu son in. Khuapi sia nasia seseam in sim a, a laak natu son in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bathsheba in a pasal kithat ci in a zaak ciang khuangai in tau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A khuangai tu hun teng a bo ciangin David in ama sia kumpi inn ah sam hi; ama ii zi hong suak a, tapa khat hing hi. Ahihang David ii ngamtatna huvau Topa lungkim ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kamsaang pa Nathan sia David kungah paisak hi. Ama kungah Nathan pai in, “Pasal nii khuapi khat sungah teang khawm hi; khat sia hau a, a khat sia zawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hau pa in khui le tuu tam mama nei hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a zawng pa ahile a leisa tuuno khat bek nei hi. Ama in tuasia pha takin khoai a, a inn ah a tate taw khang khawmsak hi. Ama ii neak lai an pawlkhat taw vaakin, a hai taw tui dawnsak a, a kaang sungah toai hi. Tuuno sia ama atu in tanu khat taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni khat ni in leangna khat a hau pa inn ah zin hong tung hi. Tua pa neak tu in mihaupa in a nganno khat zongh ngaw nuam ngawl hi; ama in mizawngpa ii tuuno laaksak in a zinpa neak tu in huan hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David sia tua mihau pa tungah thin uuk mama a, “A nungta Topa taw kiciam hi tong, hi bangin a ngamta pa a thi tu kilawm hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi bangin a tatsiat hu in a laak za tungah a zaa li in a lo kik kul tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Nangma tuasia pa ni hi,” Nathan in David munah ci hi. “Tuaciang hisia Israel ii Topa Pathian in ci hi: ‘Saul khut sung pan kong suatak a, Israel kumpipa kong suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama ii kumpi ngam le a zite nang kong pia hi; Israel le Judah kumpipa kong suaksak hi. Hi sia kicing ngawl lai ahile a zaa nii in a tamzaw hong pia zo tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahile banghangin kong thupiakte ni ngawl ni ziam? Banghangin hi tatsiatna ngamtat in nei ni ziam? Nang in Uriah sia ngal sungah na thisak hi: Ammon te in na thatlumsak hi, tua zawkciang a zi na la hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu in na khang simin na suan na paalte pawlkhat sia thisia thi ngamh in thi tu hi, banghang ziam cile nang in ka thu nong ni bua a, tuaciang Uriah ii zi na la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangma innkuan sung pan ma in khat ma in nangma ngim hong piak natu in ka kiciam hi. Na zite nangma kung pan la in midang khat ka piak ciangin hi thu na mu tu hi; ama in suntangin amate luppui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thimtham in mawna vawt ku ni hi, ahihang Israel theampo ii a mu tu in suntangin tuabang ka piangsak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in, “ Topa tungah maw zo khi hi,” ci hi. Nathan in, “ Topa in hong maisak hi; thi ngawl tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang hi bangin na ngamtatna panin Topa simmawkna lak zo na hikom na ta sia thi tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Nathan inn ah cia hi. Uriah zi taw a hin David ii ta sia Topa in a ciinasak mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David in a ta dam natu Pathian tungah thu ngen hi. Ama in bangma ne nuam ngawl a, zan simin ama ii inndoi sungah pai in suat tungah lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kumpi inn uliante in thosak nuamin hanciam hikale tho nuam ngawl a, amate taw bangma nekhawm nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nipi khat zawkciang a ta hong thi a, tuaciang David ii uliante in tua thu ama tungah son ngam ngawl uh hi. Amate in, “A ta nuntak lai zongin ih paupui ciang David in hong zo nuam ngawl hi. Na ta thi zo hi ci in bangbangin son thei tu hi ziam? Ama le ama bang khat po kilaw tha tu hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David in amate kihuau a mu ciang a tano thi zo hi, ci in phawk thei hi. Tua ahikom ama in amate munah, “Tano thi zo ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Hi hi, thi zo hi,” ci in amate in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Suat tung pan David thoto a, kibualin, a sam pot a, a puan laih hi. Tua zawkciang ama Topa ii inn sungah pai in biakna vawt hi. Kumpi inn ah a heak kik ciangin an ngen a, a kilui po ciangin ne paih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama uliante in ama munah, “Hi thu sia tel zo ngawl khu hi. Tano luhai lai in ama na kaa a, an na ne bua hi; ahihang a thi po ciang thoto in an na ne hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Hi hi, a nuntak hunsung teng kapin an tang peu khi hi. Topa in kei hong hesuak tha tu a tano thisak ngawl tu hi ci in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang tu in thi zo ahiciang banghangin an tatang lai tu khi ziam? Tano nungtasak kik thei tu khi ziam? Ni khat ni ciang ama omna ah kei pai tu khi hi, ahihang ama kei kungah hong pai kik thei ngeingawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David in a zi Bathsheba heeneam hi. Ama in luppui in, tapa khat nei kik a, David in Solomon ci in a min phuak hi. Topa in patangno sia it hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tuaciang Topa in kamsaangpa Nathan thupia a, patangno min Jedidiah phuaksak hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in ama it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua lanin Joab in Ammon te khuapi Rabbah a simna zom suak a, la zo dektak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in kamtaite paisak a, David tungah, “Rabbah sim zo khi hi, tuaciang a tui laakna zongh suan zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tu in na ngalkap om lai teng hong khawmtua ta'n a, a khuapi simin, nangma tatak ma in la in. Tua khuapi la hi ci in min nga nuam ngawl khi hi,” ci in kosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahikom David in a ngalkapte khawmtua a, Rabbah ah kuanin sim a, zothal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ammon te ii biak milim pathian Molech ii lu tung pan David in kilogramme 35 bang a ngit suangmanpha khat a kisuan khamh kumpilukhu sia la hi. David in tua suangmanpha la in ama lukhu tungah suang hi. Ama ii khuapi sung pan a laaksak vanh zongh tam mama a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a khua mite sia thing at naam, thik tumanh, thik heite taw naseamsakin, zawthawk thu taw uksuang seaksak hi. Ammon khua dangte sung a om mite zongh tuabang ma in seamsak hi. Tua zawkciang ama le a mite Jerusalem ah heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David ii tapa Absalom in a mealpha pasal nei ngawl lai suapuinumei Tamar a kici khat nei hi. Amnon a kici David ii tapa dang khat in ama dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in tua nu dei mama ahikom nat law liang hi, banghang ziam cile a teenpui tu suak thei tuak ngawl hi; ngaknu thiangtho a hina taw kizui in ama sia pate taw kimu ngawlin kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang ama in a pilvang mama, David ii suapuipa Shammah ii tapa Jonadab kici ngualtamh khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonadab in Amnon munah, “Nang sia kumpipa ii tapa hi napi, ni khat zawkciang ni khat hee mai taw om ni hi. Bang tat ni ziam?” ci hi. Ama in, “Ka suapui sealh Absalom ii suapuinu Tamar dei khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jonadab in, “Na ci kinasak in lupna zuan in. Na pa in nang ve tu in hong pai ciang, ama munah hi bangin ci in, ‘Nong hesuakna in ka suapuinu Tamar hong paisak in an hong piasak ta'n. Hi sungah ka mu tangin an hong huansak hen a, ama mama in an hong piasak ta'n ci in,’ ” ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom Amnon sia kizawmsakin lupna tung zuan hi. Kumpipa David in ama ve tu in pai a, tuaciang Amnon in, “Nong hesuakna in Tamar hi sungah hong paisak ta'n a, ama ka mu thei natu munah anluum nip pawlkhat hong vawtsak tahen, tuaciang ama mama in hong pia tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom Kumpipa David in kumpi inn sungah Tamar kam thaak a; “Amnon ii inn ah va pai ta'n a, an tawm vawtsak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama pai in lupna tungah a lup mu hi. Tua nu in anvui thauh sa pawlkhat la in, ama ii mu thei natu munah moh pawlkhat vawt hi. Tua zawkciang muhte em a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ama ii neak tu in beal sung pan sua hi, ahihang ama in ne nuam ngawl hi. Ama in, “A om theampo pusuaksak in,” ci a — tua ciang amate a vekpi ma in pusuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, ama munah “Muhte hi sung ka lupna ah hong paipui ta'n a nangma hong lui ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in muhte la in paipui hi. Tuate a piak ciangin, Amnon in zamh a, “Hong pai ta'n, lumkhawm tawng!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tuabangin zawthawk thu taw ka minsiat natu hong ngamtasak heak in! Mu thadahuai mama hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangbangin mipi kawm ah khuadak ngam nawn tu khi ziam? Tuaciang, nangma Israel ngam sungah min siacip tu ni hi. Nong hesuakna in kumpipa paupui po lete ama in kei, nang atu hong pia leilam tu um khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang ama in a nangai bua hi; tuaciang ama sia tha hatzaw ahikom buanin khialpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Amnon in tua nu nasia takin ngaimaw hi; a masa lai a itna sangin tu in a ngaimawkna nasia zaw kan hi. Ama in, “Tai in!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in, “Tai ngawl tu khi hi. Tu bang a nong betkeak sia, na vawt sa khialna sangin zongh a lianzaw khialna ahi hi!” ci in zo hi. Ahihang Amnon in ama ii pau a ngai nuam bua hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ama in a aituam naseamte samin, “Hi numei ka muna ah omsak heak vun! Doipua ah notkeak vun a, kong kalh vun!” ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naseampa in ama doipua ah koi in kongkha kalh san uh hi. Tamar sia tua hun lai in kumpipa tanu, pasal nei ngawl lai te kizepna ahi puantual baan sau silh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in a lu tungah vut kipoai a, a puantual eaukeak in, a khut sungah a mai phumin kap kawmin paisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A suapuipa Absalom in ama a mu ciang, “Amnon in hong vawtsia ahi bua ziam? Suapui nu awng, tuaza in na thin lalsak heak in. Ama na suapui sealh hi, tua ahikom kuama munah son heak in!” ci hi. Tuabangin Tamar sia Absalom ii inn ah hee in lungzuangin om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa David in thupiang teng a zaak ciang a thinso hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaciang Absalom in Amnon sia a suapuinu a buansak hu in huatsa mama a, pau zongh paupui nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum nii zawkciang Ephraim khua hui, Baal Hazor ah Absalom in a tuumul meetsak a, ama in kumpipa tapate theampo tua munah sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in Kumpipa David kungah pai in, “Kumpipa awng, ka tuute mul meetsak khi hi. Nang le na uliante hong pai in tua poai ah nong kihel tu uh ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Hong kihel thei ngawl tu khu hi, ka tapa awng, ka vekpi in hong pai thong le ung, nang atu ngim huai lei tu hi,” kumpipa in ci hi. Absalom in sam hamtang ahihang kumpipa uuk ngawlin, Absalom cia a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang Absalom in, “Tua ahile pha hi, ka suapuipa Amnon beak nong paisak buatu ziam?” ci hi. “Banghangin ama hong pai kul tu ziam?” ci in kumpipa in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahihang a khakbel ciang David in Amnon le a tapa dangte theampo Absalom taw a paisak dong ngen hamtang hi. Absalom in kumpipa taw a kiphu an neak poaipi khat vawt hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tuaciang a naseamte thupia a: “Amnon ii zu a kham mama hun hong he tavun a, thu kong piak ciangin ama that vun. Lau heak vun. Keima in vaipuak la khi hi. Hang vun a, haisaang heak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuabangin naseamte in Absalom thupiak bangin Amnon that uh hi. David ii tapa dang teng sia a laate tung to in taikeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate inn lam a zawzot laitakin, David munah thu kiko a: “Absalom in na tapate theampo thatlum zo hi — khat zongh kikhe ngawl hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kumpipa hong ding a, a puansilh lai sia heena taw eaukeak in, leiliik hi. Ama taw a omkhawm naseamte zongh a puante eaukeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahihang David ii suapuipa Shammah ii tapa Jonadab in, “Kumpipa awng, amate in na tapa theampo that siat ngawl hi. Amnon bek thi hi. Amnon in Absalom suapuinu Tamar a buan pan kipan hi bangin a ngamtat tu sia a khensat sa ahi hunlam Absalom na et ciang son thei ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahikom na tapate theampo thi hi ci thuthang sia um heak in; Amnon bekma kithat hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua lanin Absalom tai zo hi. Tua zawk bekin ngal encik ngalkappa in Horonaim sang pan mualtung lampi hong tawnsuk mihonpi khat mu hi. Ama in kumpipa kungah pai in a mu teng ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jonadab in David munah, “Tuate sia kong sonsa bangin na tapate hong cia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hi teng a son zawk po ciang, David ii tapate hong tum a: amate kap a, David le a uliante zongh nasia takin kap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Absalom sia tai in, Ammihud ii tapa Talmai, Geshur kumpipa kung zuan a, tuaciang tua munah kum thum sung om hi. David in a tapa Amnon atu khuangei pi ma khuangai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />ahihang Amnon thina huvau a khuangaina a theau zawkciang a tapa Absalom bebek thangai in hong om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa David in Absalom ngai mama hi ci in Joab in he hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua ahikom ama in nupi pilvang khat Tekoa ah a teang sia samsak hi. Ama hong thet ciang Joab in ama munah, “Kikhuangaisak in; na khuangai puante silh in a, na sam pot heak in. Khuangei mama khuangai in a omsa nupi khat bangin kithoai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang nupi nu sia kumpipa kungah va pai ta'n a, ci a kong sawl teng va ci ta'n,” ci hi. Tua zawkciang Joab in a pau natu teng hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Numei nu kumpipa kungah pai in, zatak piakna in lei ah bok hi, tuaciang hi bangin ci hi, “Hong hu ta'n, Kumpipa awng!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Bang dei ni ziam?” ci in ama in dongh hi. Tua nu in, “Kei sia a zawng meingong nu khi hi, topa awng. Ka pasal sia thi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa awng, keima in tapa nii ka nei a, ni khat ni ciang kuama a khen tu a om ngawlna lo sungah kihau in, khat in a dang khat sia thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaciang tu in, topa awng, ka mealheakte theampo in hong langpan hi, a suapuipa a thalup hu in ama zongh a thalup thei natu in ka tapa sia amate khut sungah aapin hong sawl hi. Hi bangin amate hong ngamta le tapa nei nawn ngawl tu khi hi. Amate in ka lam etna a khakbel sia hong suk siatsak tu a, ka pasal min kilaw natu zongh tapa om nawn ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Inn ah cia kik ta'n, keima in hi thu kong thintoisak tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kumpipa awng, bang po na vawt zong, hi thu tungtaang ah kei le ka bangkua in mawsiat thuak taw ung; nang le kumpi innkuan sia maw ngawl tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Khat po in hong tawng le keima kungah ama hong paipui ta'n, tua hile ngim hong pia kik ngeingawl tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in, “Kumpipa awng, nong hesuakna in, Topa na Pathian tungah ka mealheakte ka tapa thi huvau phulam natu vaipuak nei sia in ka tapa a om lai sia a thalupna taw khialna lianzaw lai a vawt ngawl natu in thu hong ngetsak ta'n,” ci hi. “A nungta Topa min taw kamciam hong pia khi hi, na tapa sia tawmno zongh bangma tat ngawl tu hi,” David in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kumpipa awng, nong hesuakna in, kam khat hong pausak lai ta'n,” nupi nu in ci hi. Ama in, “Son in,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nupi nu in ama munah, “Banghangin Pathian mite tungah tuabang khialna vawt ni ziam? Nangma zongh na tapa sia lei dangah a peamna pan cia kiksak ngawl ni hi, tua ahikom tu mahiat a na pau teng taw nangma le nangma mawpu kisua ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ei ih vekpi in thi tu hi hing; ei sia lei ah tuibua taw kibangin, kiluak kik thei ngawl hi. Pathian ngawngawn in a thisate nungtasak kik ngawl hi, ahihang kumpipa in peamta in a om mihing khat sia a nobel in a cia kik natu lam zonsak thei ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu in, kumpipa awng, nang kungah hong pai a hi bangin thu kong sonna sia, tua mite in kei hong tawn hang hi, tua ahikom nangma tungah hong son leng kong nget sia hong vawtsak tu ci in keima le keima lametna nei kisa khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian ii a mite a piak ngam le lei pan kei le ka tapa hong heam nuamin ko thalup hong sawm sia kung pan zong nangma in kong son teng hong ngai a, hong hun tu um khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima le keima tungah ka kicina pan, topa, na kamciamna in keima hong ngammuangsak tu hi, banghang ziam cile kumpipa sia Pathian ii vantung mi taw kibangin a pha le a sia khentel thei hi. Topa na Pathian nang taw omkhawm tahen!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Thu khat hong dongh tu khi hi, tuaciang ahi babangin hong son nanak tu ni hi,” ci in zo hi. Tua nu in, “Kumpipa awng, nong dok nop po hong dongh ta'n,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in, “Tu a bang teng nong sep sia Joab ii hong sawl ahi ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Tua nu in “A thiangtho nate theampo taw kiciam khi hi, Kumpipa awng nong thudok sia ka pial thei natu mama a lam om ngawl hi. Na ulianpa Joab in ka sep tu le ka pau tu teng hong son takpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang ama in hi vai teng thiangsak nuam ahi hu in a vawt ahi hi. Kumpipa nang sia Pathian ii vantunglalang bangin ciim a thupiang theampo he ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A zawkciang kumpipa in Joab munah, “Na dei bangin sep tu ka khensat zo hi. Va pai ta'n a tua khangno Absalom sia hi sungah hong ciapui ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joab in David ii mai ah zatakna taw kileisee sukin, “Pathian in thupha hong pia tahen, Kumpipa awng! Tu in kei tungah nong lungkim hunlam sia kong nget teng nong piak ciangin ka he hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama thoto in Geshur ah pai a, Absalom sia Jerusalem ah ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang kumpipa in Absalom sia kumpi inn sungah a teen ngawl natu in thupia hi. Kumpipa in, “Ama mu nuam ngawl khi hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Absalom sia ama inn ah teangin kumpipa mai ah kilaak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel ngam sungah mealphatna lam sang Absalom bangin a minthang kuama om ngawl hi; a lu pan a peang dong sit baanna nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A sam saa mama a, sau leih in a ngit leih ciang kum sim khatvei veu tan hi. A sam ngitna sia kumpi khaiteena taw tee ciang, kilogramme 2 vaal pha hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Absalom in tapa thum le Tamar kici tanu khat nei a, a mealpha mama numei khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Absalom sia kumpipa taw kimu ngawlin kum nii sung Jerusalem ah teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama vai in Joab sia kumpipa kung paisak nuam a, samsak hi; ahihang Joab hong pai ngawl hi. Khatvei ma Absalom in Joab samsak kik ahihang Joab pai nuam peang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahikom Absalom in a naseamte munah, “En vun, Joab ii lo sia keima taw kingizawng hi, tuaciang a sungah mangtaang kiciing hi. Pai tavun a va hal tavun,” ci hi. Tua ahiciang amate pai in tua lo hal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Absalom inn ah Joab pai in, “Banghangin na naseamte in ka lo hong halsak ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Absalom in, “Banghang ziam cile kong sam sasak hang nang hong pai ngawl ni hi. Kumpipa kungah pai in, kei taangin thu hong doksak lete oai khi hi: ‘Banghangin Geshur nusia in hi sungah hong pai kana khi ziam? Tua munah om po leng phazaw tu hi ve,’ ci hi. Absalom in zom to a, “Kumpipa taw ka kimu natu hong vaihawm ta'n, tuaciang kei maw ka hi le hong thatlum tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahikom Joab sia Kumpipa David kungah pai a, Absalom ii ci teng son hi. Kumpipa in Absalom samsak a, ama pai in kumpipa mai lei ah hong kun suk hi. Kumpipa in ama muakin namh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia zawkciang Absalom in ama atu siphu ngalleang khat le siphu pawlkhat heang a, ama a cing mihing 50 koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama zing tuungin tho a, khuapi kongpi hui lampi ah ding hi. Mihing khat po sia ngual taw thu kinei a, kumpipa khensak nuam in hong pai a om simin, Absalom in sam a, koisung pan hong pai ni ziam ci in dongh bul hi. Tuaciang ama tungah a nam min sia a son zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Absalom in, “En in, thukham in nang hong panpui hi, ahihang kumpipa luangin nang thu hong sitin thu hong khen tu kuama om ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang hi bang veu belap a, “Keima thukhenmang hi leng uuk meak ing! Tua hile ngual taw thu kinei, ahibuale ama ii neisa a nga kik nuam khat pawpo kei kungah hong pai thei tu a, thu khaikimin ka khensak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabangin mihing khat Absalom mai ah kun in hong neak ciangin Absalom in a khut thaakin koai a, namh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa tung pan thu khaikim khenna thangai a hong pai Israel mi theampo Absalom in hi bang veu in vawt ahikom amate ii panpuina maan nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum li zawkciang Absalom in David kumpipa munah, “Topa awng, Hebron ah hong paisak ta'n, Topa tungah ka piak kamciam teng seam nuam khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Syria ngam Geshur ah ka teen lai in, Topa tungah kamciam ka piakna pan, ama in kei, Jerusalem ah hong la kik le Hebron ah ama bia tu khi hi, ka ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Thin nuam takin va pai ta'n,” kumpipa in ci hi. Tua ahikom Absalom sia Hebron ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang ama in Israel namte theampo kungah kamtai paisak in, “Lemle aw na zaak uh ciang, ‘Hebron ah Absalom sia kumpi suak zo hi!’ ci in a au natu in sonsak hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Absalom ii sapna taw Jerusalem ah ama taw a paikhawm mihing 200 pha hi; amate in a sawmna thu bangma he ngawlin, thinpha lungpha taw pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang Absalom in Kumpipa David ii thudokte khat ahi Gilo khua ah Ahithophel zongh sangaw biakpiakna a vawt laitakin samsak hi. Kumpipa langpan tu a sawmna sia hong thahatin, Absalom ii nungzuite tam vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kamtai khat in David munah, “Israel te in Absalom tungah a thumaan natu in kamciam pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom David in Jerusalem ah ama taw a om a uliante theampo munah, “Absalom khut panin ih suakta nuam le thakhat ma ih tai kul tu hi! Manlang vun! Tua ahibuale ama hai ngawlin hi mun hong theng tu a, hong zo in khuapi sungah a om theampo hong that tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in, “Hi hi, Kumpipa awng, na ci babangin ngamta tu in kinging khu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom kumpipa sia kumpi inn en tu a nusiat a zino sawm teng simngawl, a innkuanpui dang teng le a uliante taw tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa le a mite theampo khuapi a nusiat tu ciangin. inn mong khakbel sia ah tawlnga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpi a cing teng sia ama mai kaantan in a pai suak laitak a uliante theampo zongh ama hui ah ding tek hi. Gath pan a zui ngalkap 600 te zongh hong kaantan uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuaciang kumpipa in amate lampuipa Ittai munah, “Banghangin ko taw hong paikhawm tu ni ziam? Heak kik in a, kumpi thak sia taw om ta'n. Nang sia ngamdangmi ni hi, na ngam panin ngaltai khat hi ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi sungah tawmvei sung bekma hong teang na hi ciang, banghangin nang, kei taw hong vakthap kawkoaisak tu khi ziam? Koisung zuan tu khi ziam ci in keima zongh in he ngawl khi hi. Heak kik in a, na ngammipuite zongh tonpui ta'n — Topa in no tungah hong dik tahen a hong thumaan tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang Ittai in, “Kumpipa awng, Topa min taw kiciam khi hi, thi tu keak a kul zong na paina po ah pai tawntung tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in, “Pha hi! Pai suak in!” ci in zo hi. Tua ahikom Ittai sia a mi teng le ama a bealhte theampo taw pai suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />David nungzuite in a nusiat tak ciang mipite a ngingin hong kap uh hi. Kumpipa in Kidron lui kaantan a, a mite in zui in amate duisung manaw in paikhawm hon uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thiampi Zadok, tuaciang ama taw Thuciamna Thingkuang thiangtho a pua Levi mite zongh tualai ah kihel in om uh hi. Amate in Thuciamna Thingkuang lei ah koisukin, mi theampo ii khuapi a nusiat dong kisuanh kik ngawl uh hi. Thiampi Abiathar zongh tua munah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kumpipa in Zadok munah, “Thuciamna Thingkuang khuapi sungah heak pui kik ta'n. Topa in kei tungah hong lungkim ahile ni khat ni ciangin kei hong heak kiksak tu a, tuasia le a omna mun hong musak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in kei tungah hong lungkim buale — tuasia ciang ama uuk bang po hong vawt tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in Zadok munah a ci lai na pan, “En in, na tapa Ahimaaz le Abiathar ii tapa Jonathan tonpui in khuapi sung ma ah thinnuam takin zuan kik tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua lanin nang tung pan thuthak ka zaak dong ngun kanna pan kong ngak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahikom Zadok le Abiathar in Jerusalem ah Thuciamna Thingkuang puak kik in tua khua ah om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />David in Olive Mual ah a kapsa in kaato a; khuangaina lim lak in a peangnguakin om a, a lu siin hi. Ama a zuite theampo in zongh a lu uh puan taw siinin kap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahithophel in Absalom ii leedona ah pawm hi ci in David tungah a kison ciangin, “ Topa awng, nong hesuakna in Ahithophel ii ngaisut piakna sia a lui thawthong suaksak in!” ci in thu ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Biakna mun khat sia ii a omna mual tungah David hong thet ciangin, Arch mi ahi a lawm muan Hushai taw kimu a, ama sia a puan ki eaukeak in a lu tungah leivui kibuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />David in ama munah, “Kei taw nong tonkhop hang kei nong hu theina bangma om ngawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />ahihang khuapi ah heak kik in Absalom munah na pa atu na ka sep bangma, tu in nangma atu thumaan takin hong sepsak tu khi hi, va ci lete kei hong hu thei zaw tu ni hi. Tuaciang Ahithophel ii ngaisut piakna peuma na hi thei za in nalh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thiampi Zadok le thiampi Abiathar te tua munah om tu hi; kumpi inn sungah na zaak theampo amate tungah son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate ii a tapate Ahimaaz le Jonathan amate kungah om hi, tuaciang thu na kaikhop theampo amate in kei hong puaksak thei tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ahikom David lawmpa Hushai sia Absalom hong thet bek laitakin khuapi sungah heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in mualdawn a kan zawkciang thakhat thu in Mephibosheth ii naseampa Ziba taw kisi hi, ama in laa nii hong keng a, a laate in anluum luum 200, sapitko bom zakhat, thingnga hing bom zakhat le savun ip khat dim sapittui hong pua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa David in, “Tuate theampo bang tu ci ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Ziba in, “Laate sia kumpipa innkuanpuite to natu hi a, anluum le thingngate sia mihingte neak tu, tuaciang sapittui sia dui sungah amate a toi ciang a dawn tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Na topa Saul ii tupa Mephibosheth koisung a om ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Ziba in, “Ama Jerusalem ah om hi, banghang ziam cile tu in a pu Saul ii neisa theampo, Israel te in ama tungah pia tu in um tatak hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in Ziba munah, “Mephibosheth ii neisa theampo nangma tang tu ni hi,” ci hi. Ziba in “Kei na naseampa khi hi. Kumpipa nang hong lungkimsak tawntung tu pa hong suaksak ta'n,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa David sia Bahurim a thet ciangin Saul mealheak khat, Gera ii tapa Shimei sia ama taw kisi tu in hong pai in ama haamsiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David sia ama uliante le a cingte in kiim uum napi Shimei in suang taw deang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Shimei in haamsiat a, “Tai in! Tai in! Mi that pa! Mimaw mikhial pa!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang in Saul ii kumpi ngam na suan a, tu in Topa in Saul ii innkuanpuite na suamlup hu in daan hong pia hi. Topa in kumpi ngam sia na tapa Absalom hong piaksak hi, tu in lalcip zo ni hi, nang mi that pa!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nu Zeruiah ahi Abishai in, “Kumpipa awng, banghangin ui hisia in nang haamsiatsak ni ziam? Ama ii kungah hong paisak ta'n a, a lu hong tansak ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa in Abishai le a suapuipa Joab munah, “Hisia no taw bangma kisai bo. Topa ii sawl hu in hong haamsiat ahile akua in khaam thei tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang David in Abishai le a uliante theampo munah, “Keima tapa in kei hong thatlum nuam a hanciam hi; tua ahiciang Benjamin mi khat ii ngamtatna banghangin lamdang sa nu ziam? Topa in a haamsiat natu in sawl hi; tua ahiciang ama nguak koi po vun a, tuabang hisak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in ka lungmanna hong heaksak tha tu a, ama ii hong haamsiatna sia taangin kei atu thupha pawlkhat hong pia nuam hi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom David le a mite a lampai zom suak hi. Mualpangh a paina ah Shimei in amate pha valep a; a pai kawkawm in amate haamsiat a, suang le lei taw deang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa le a mite theampo Jordan ngun a thet ciangin, amate a tha uh zawm mama zo ahikom tua munah tawlnga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Absalom le ama taw kikop Israel te theampo Jerusalem khua ah tum a, Ahithophel zongh amate taw om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David ii muan a lawmpa Hushai in Absalom taw a kisik ciang, “Kumpipa a khansau tahen! Kumpipa a khansau tahen!” ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Absalom in, “Na lawmpa David tungah na thumaanna teng bang suak ziam? Banghangin ama taw ton ngawl ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hushai in, “Banghangin ton thei tu khi ziam? Topa ii tealpa, mipite ii teal pa, le Israel mi bup ii teal pa sangah pang khi hi. Kei nang taw om tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A khakbel in ci leang, ka topa ii tapa atu ka seam buale akua dang atu seam tu khi ziam? Na pa atu ka sepsak bangma in tu in nang atu hong sepsak tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Absalom in Ahithophel sang nga in, “Tu in hi sungah ei teng om ci leang ih ngamtat natu ngaisutna bang hong pia tu ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahithophel in, “Va pai ta'n a, na pa ii kumpi inn a cing tu in a nusiat a zinote luppui in. Tua hile Israel a om theampo in nang sia na pa in a ngalin hong nei hi, ci in he tu uh hi, tuaciang na nungzuite nasia takin kihansua tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in kumpi inn khuvum tungah Absalom atu puanbuk khat khaksak a, Absalom tumin ngual theampo mu tangin, a pa ii zinote luppui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hunin Ahithophel ii ngaisut piak pawpo sia Pathian kammal bang keak ma in kisaang a; David le Absalom in zui khawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawk a ngeingawlin, Ahithophel in Absalom munah, “Pasal tulsawm le tulnii hong tealsak ta'n a, tu nitakin David ka na del tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama a toi laitak le a thinkiam laitakin ka na sim tu hi. Ama lau tu a, a mite theampo taikeak tu hi. Keima in kumpipa bekma ka that tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuaciang mo khat a pasal kung a zot kik bangin nangma kungah a mite kong paipui tu hi. Na thalup nop sia mihing khat bekma hi a; a dang teng bangma tat ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi ngaisutna sia Absalom le Israel lampuite atu in ngaisutna pha hi tuak sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Absalom in “Tu in Hushai sam vun, ama in bang ci nop a nei ziam ngai sin tawng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hushai a thet ciang, Absalom in ama munah son a, “Ahithophel ii ngaisut hong piak hi bang teng hi; tuasia ih zui tu ziam? Ih zui buatu le, ih ngamtat natu nangma hong son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hushai in, “Tu tungin Ahithophel ii ngaisutna hong piak sia pha ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na pa David le a mite sia ngalsim a hatte hi a, a note a kilaaksak vompui a kiitakhuai za in kiitakhuai hi. Na pa sia ngalsim zia a he sa khat hi a, zanin a mite taw mun khat ah omkhawm ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu laitak lian bangin ama sia suanghawng sung khat ziam a dang mun khat ziam ah om tu hi. David ii na mite a sim po ciang tua thu a za pawpo in na mite ngallel sa hi ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tawpite bangin kiitak a nei ngawl a hangsan belte ngawngawn lau tu hi, banghang ziam cile Israel ngam a om a kuama po in na pa sia ngalkap lian khat hi a, a mite zongh ngalsim a hatte vive hi ci in he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei ii ngaisut kong piak nopna pan, tuipivaal a senneal za bangin a tam Israel te, ngam mong khat pan mong khat dong khawmtua in a, tuaciangin ngalsimna ah nangma mama in lampui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David sia a omna po ah ih mu tu a, tuaciang ama in bang piang ziam ci a heak ma in ih sim tu hi. Ama ahizong a mite ahizong a suakta om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in khuapi sung tuu in a nungkin le zong, ih mite in khauzeente keng tek tu a, a khuapi mama a nuaisang kuam sungah ih kaisuk tu hi. Tua mual tungah suangtum khat dongin kikhe ngawl tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Absalom le Israel te theampo in, “Hushai ii ngaisut piakna sia Ahithophel aa sangin phazaw hi,” ci uh hi. Absalom ii tuasiatna hong tun natu in Ahithophel ii ngaisut pha a piak sia a kizui ngawl natu in Topa in khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Hushai in thiampite Zadok le Abiathar te munah, Absalom le Israel lampuite tungah ama in bang ngaisutna teng pia a, Ahithophel in bang ngaisutna teng pia ziam ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hushai in belap a, “Tu in manlang vun! Ama le a mite kiman in a kithalup ngawl natu in, ngun kaantanna dui sungah zanin om heak hen a, Jordan ngun thakhat a kaantan paih natu David tungah thu puak vun,” cisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abiathar ii tapa Jonathan le Zadok ii tapa Ahimaaz te in Jerusalem khua puasia a om Enrogel cik panin ngak uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate in khuapi sung a tum sia kimusak ngam ngawl hi. Naseam numei khat hun maanmaan in pai a, bang thu veu om ziam ci in amate tungah son hi, amate in Kumpipa David kungah pai in tua thute sonsawn uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang ni khat ni ciangin patang khat in amate mu luilam hi, tuaciang ama in Absalom munah son hi; tua ahikom amate in manlang takin tai a Bahurim khua sung pasal khat ii inn ah buu uh hi. Ama in a inn hui ah tuikhuk khat nei a, tua ii sungah tuaksuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasal pa ii zi in a sit natu khat la in tuikhuk vang tungah zalh a, antang pawlkhat a tungah poai hi, tua ahiciang kuama in bangma a lamdang a mu bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Absalom ii uliante hong pai a, tuaciang numeinu munah, “Ahimaaz le Jonathan koi sungah om ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Tua nu in, “Amate ngun kaanin pai zo hi,” ci hi. Pasalte in tuate ngeal zong ahihang mu zo ngawl ahiciang, Jerusalem ah heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate ii pai zawkciang Ahimaaz le Jonathan te tuikhuk sung pan pusuakin, David kumpipa kungah pai a tua thu ko hi. Ahithophel ii ama langpanin a ngealna teng ko a, tuaciang, “Manlang vun a, ngun kaantan vun,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahiciang David le a mite Jordan ngun kaantan a, khuavak bek in amate theampo a ngalkhat theng siat zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahithophel in ama ii ngaisut piakna kizui ngawl hi ci in a mu ciang, a laa tung to in ama ii khuapi ah cia kik hi. Ama vai tuatuamte ahi tu bangin a vawt siat zawkciang ama le ama awklum hi. Ama sia a innkuan ii thaan ah kiphum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Absalom le Israel te ii Jordan ngun a kaantan hunin, David sia Mahanaim khua theng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />(Absalom in Joab taangin Amasa sia ngalkaphonpi ukpa in koi hi. Amasa sia Ishmael mi Jether ii tapa hi a; ama ii nu sia Nahash ii tanu, Joab ii nu Zaruiah ii suapuinu Abigail ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Absalom le a mite in Gilead ngam ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />David sia Mahanaim hong thet ciang Ammon ngam Rabbah khuapi pan Nahash ii tapa Shobi, Lodebar pan Ammiel ii tapa Machir le Gilead ngam Rogelim pan Barzillai te in muak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in meekuangte, tungbealte, zanpuan, tuaciang an zongh David le a mite atu in hong puak hi; zungtaang, mangtaang, anvui, antang kan, benaang, be, khuaitui, noaikhal, noaidiat le tuu pawlkhat hong puak uh hi. Amate in David le a mite dui sungah a toi tu, ngilkial dangtaak in a om tu hunlam he uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa David in a mite theampo khawmtua in, tulkhat pawl, zakhat pawl ci in khen a, a uk tu uliante koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in tuate pawl thum in kuansak a, Joab le a suapuipa Abishai, Gath pan Ittai te thum in tua pawlte khat tek uksak hi. Tuaciang kumpipa in, “Keima zongh no taw kuankhawm tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in, “Ko taw hong kuankhawm ngawl tu ni hi. Ei a taanglai teng kiheak in ih tai ahizong, ei a lang ma hong kithat ahizong ih ngalte atu bangma kilamdanna om ngawl tu hi; ahihang nang na hile ko tulsawm taw na man neina kikim hi. Hi lai khuapi sungah om in huna hong puak lete phazaw tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Pha na sakbel uh bangin ngamta tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi. Tuasia zawkciang a ngalkapte tulkhat pawl, zakhat pawl, a pawl a pawl in a kuan ciangin, David sia kongpi hui ah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Joab, Abishai le Ittai te munah thupia a, “Keima nong ngaisutna in, tangvalpa Absalom bangma na law heak vun,” ci hi. Ngalkap mite theampo in David ii a uliante tungah hi a thupiakna sia za kim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David ii ngalkaphonpi sia ngamsung theampo ah hong kuanin, Ephraim duisung ah Israel te sim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel te in David ii mite lel uh hi; tua ni in nasia lel mama uh a, tulkul kithatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngamsung bup ah kidona hong kilaw a, duisung ah a thi sia ngalphual ah a kithat sangin tamzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thakhat thu in Absalom in David ii mite taw kisi uh hi. Absalom sia laa tungah to in, a laa sia oak thingkung lian nuai khat ah a pai laitak thingbaak kawm ah, Absalom ii lutang awk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David ii mite khat in ama mu a, Joab tungah, “Topa awng, Absalom sia oak thingkung tungah a kaai ka mu hi,” ci in ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joab in, “Mu na hi le banghangin a munah thatlum paih ngawl ni ziam? Keima mama in ngunn tang sawm le kawngkhau khat hong pia zawsap tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang tua pa in, “Ngunn tang tulkhat keak nong pia hial zong kumpi pa tapa tungah ka khutme khat zongh laamto ngawl tu khi hi. Kumpipa in nang le Abishai, Ittai tungah, ‘Keima nong ngaisutna in khangno pa Absalom sia bangma na law heak vun’ ci in thu hong piak sia za tek khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang kumpipa thupiak mang ngawlin Absalom that hi leng, kumpipa in za nanak tu hi — ama in thu theampo za hi — tuaciang nangma in kei hong hung ngawl tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joab in “Nang taw hun sauzaw bosak thawthong nawn bua tong,” ci hi. Joab in tei thum la in, oak thing tung a kikhai a nungta lai Absalom ii awm hol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciang Joab ngalkap sawm in Absalom hong neak in, thatlum vet uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngal kido tawlngak natu in Joab in lemle tum natu thupia a, a ngalkapte Israel te a delna uh pan heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in Absalom ii luang la in duisung dum thuk khat sungah a lotsuk zawk uh ciang suangtum honpui khat taw siin uh hi. Israel te theampo taimang in a inn tek zuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Absalom in a nuntak lai in, a min kilaw natu tapa nei ngawl ahikom, Kumpipa Kuam a kicina munah ama atu in khansuang vawt in phut hi. Tua bangin ama min ma kivaw a, tuni dong ciang Absalom ii Khan kici lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Zadok ii tapa Ahimaaz in Joab munah, “ Topa in a ngalte khut sung pan ama a hutna thupha kumpipa tungah son tu in hong taisak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joab in, “Hi ngawl hi, tuni in thupha bangma puak ngawl tu ni hi. Nidang khat pawpo ciang na uuk le hi thei hi, ahihang tuni in puak ngawl tu ni hi, banghang ziam ci le kumpipa ii tapa thi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Ethiopia a sila pa tungah, “Pai in, na mu teng kumpipa tungah son ta'n,” ci hi. Sila pa sia kun a tai paih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahimaaz in, “Bang thu po piang kale awlmaw bong; nong hesuakna in tua thu zong keima hong puaksak po ta'n,” ci veve hi. Joab in, “Ka tapa awng, bang tu ci kenkon ni ziam? Tua atu in letsong bangma nga beak ngawl tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Bangpo a piang zong pai nuam khi hi,” Ahimaaz in ci kik hi. Joab in, “Tua ahile va pai ta'n,” ci hi. Ahimaaz zongh lam ah hong taisuk in, Jordan Kuam kaantan a, hai ngawlin silapa suangkhial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />David sia khuapi kongpi puanung le sungnung kilaklaw mun awngna ah to hi. Ngal vilpa sia khuapi uumna luphung vuum tungah kaato a, kongpi ii tung innkhum tungah ding hi; ama in khua a et le pasal khat ama nguakin hong tai mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in oksan suk a kumpipa munah son hi, tuaciang kumpipa in, “Ama nguak ahile thupha hong puak hi tu hi,” ci hi. A tai pa sia hong nai vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaciang ngalvil pa in pasal dang khat ma ama nguakin hong tai mu leleau a, kongkhapi cing pa oksan suk hi. “En in! Zia sungah pasal dang khat ma hong tai hi!” ci hi. Kumpipa in, “Hisia zongh in thupha hong puak hi” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngalvil pa in, “A masa a hong tai sia Ahimaaz ii tai bangin tai hi,” ci hi. Kumpipa in, “Ama mihing pha khat hi a, thupha hong puak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahimaaz in kumpipa nuksetna kam pau in ama mai lei ah kisepsuk hi, tuaciang, “Kumpipa awng Topa na Pathian pok in, ama in na lang pan hong leedo mite hong zosak hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tangvalpa Absalom a suakta ziam?” ci in kumpipa in dongh hi. Ahimaaz in, “Topa awng, na ulianpa Joab in kei hong paisak lai in a buai lialua khat ka mu a, bang ziam ci in ka son thei bua hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Zia lai ah ding in,” kumpipa in ci a; tuaciang ama tua munah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Ethiopia silapa hong theng a, kumpipa munah, “Kumpipa awng, nang atu thupha khat hong puak khi hi! Tuni in Topa in nang hong leedo te theampo hong zosak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tangvalpa Absalom a suak ta na ziam?” ci in kumpipa in dongh hi. Sila pa in, “Ama thuak sia na ngalte theampo le, tuaciang nang hong leedo theampo in thuak le ka oai hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kumpipa khuangai mama hi. Kongpi suazoai tung inndoi sungah kaato in kap hi. A pai kawkawmin, “Aw, ka tapa! Ka tapa Absalom! Absalom ka ta awng! Nang ka tapa ii thi luangin kei thi zaw leng maw! Absalom ka tapa!” ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa David sia Absalom hu in khuangai a, kakap hi ci in Joab tungah kison hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuabangin ngalzawna lungdamna sia tua ni in David ii a ngalkapte atu in heena hong suak hi, banghang ziam cile a tapa thi hu in kumpipa a tauna teng amate in za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngal kisimna phual panin a tai a maizum ngalkapte bangin, amate sia khuapi sungah thim takin hong tum kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in a mai hum in nging takin, “Aw ka tapa! Ka tapa Absalom! Absalom ka tapa!” ci in kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa ii inn ah Joab pai in ama munah, “Tuni in na mite — nang le na tapate na tanute, na zite le na zinote nuntakna hong huu mite maimawlsak ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang hong it teng na langpan a, nang hong ensan teng na panpui hi. Na uliante le na mite sia bangma in hong heang ngawl na hi sia kitelthiangsak zo ni hi. Tuni in Absalom nungta hen a, ko teng theampo thi zaw le ung na lungdam zaw phial tu in hong mu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu in va pai ta'n a, na mite lungmuangsak kik ta'n. Topa min lo in ka kiciamna pan, tuabangin nong vawt buale zingsang ciangin amate sung pan khat zongh in nang hong koppui nawn ngawl tu hi. Tuasia in na khan tawntung tuasiatna nasia belh na thuak hi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kumpipa kikhuangkho a, hong pai in khuapi kongpi hui ah to hi. A mite in ama sia tualai ah a om hunlam a zaak uh ciangin ama kiim ah hong kikaikhawm uh hi. Tua hun sungin Israel te theampo tai in amate inn tek zuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngam buppi sungah amate le amate hong kihau uh hi. “Kumpipa David in ih ngalte khut sung panin hong suatak hi,” khat le khat kici uh hi. “Ama in Philistine te khut sung panin hong suatak a, ahihang ama sia tu in Absalom kung pan tai in ngam nusia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Absalom sia ih kumpipa tu in sathau ih noai hi, ahihang ama ngalphual ah kithat hi. Tua ahiciang banghangin khat po in Kumpipa David ciapui kik tu hanciam ngawl ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel te ii pauna teng David kungah kison hi. Tua ahikom thiampi Zadok le Abiathar te Judah lampuite a dongh tu in samsak hi. Ama in, “A kumpi inn sungah kumpipa a cia kik natu a hute sung pan banghangin note a hu khakbel hi tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />No sia ka mealheakte nu hi, ka chi le ka sa nu hi; banghangin ka cia kik natu hong hu khakbel te hi nu ziam?” ci in donghsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in Amasa tungah hi bangin cisak si hi, “Nang ka mealheak ni hi. Tu pan kipan Joab taangin ka ngalkaphonpi ukpa in hong koi khi hi. Tuabangin ka vawt buale Pathian in hong vaatlum tahen!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David kammalte in Judah mite theampo ii thumaan takin a panpuina a cingin piangsak a, amate in ama le a uliante hong heak kik natu kam thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa hong cia kik lamin Judah mite in Jordan ngun ah muak in, a ngun kan na ah a cing tu in Gilgal ah amate hong pai ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua hun ma in, Bahurim pan Gera ii tapa, Benjaminte Shimei zongh Jordan ah Kumpipa David taw kisi tu in manlang in hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in Benjamin namte tulkhat tonpui hi. Tuaciang Saul ii innkuan naseampa Ziba zongh a tapa sawm le nga le a naseam kul taw hong pai in, kumpipa thet ma in Jordan theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa le a pawlte ngun a kan laitak a cing tu le kumpipa ii dei babangin a seam tu in amate ngun hong kan uh hi. Kumpipa ii ngun kaantan tu a kithoai laitak Shimei hong pai in ama mai ah hong kilei see suk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Kumpipa awng, nong hesuakna in Jerusalem na nusiat ni in nang tungah ka ngamtat khialna teng hong makngilsak ta'n. Tuasia taw kei hong langpan heak in a, thinngil laingil ah na paai heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa awng mawna vawt zo ka hi hunlam kihe khi hi, tuaciang tua hu ma in saksang namte sung pan tuni in kumpipa taw kisi tu in hong pai phitbel pa khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zeruiah ii tapa Abishai hong pau a: “Shimei sia thalup tu hi, banghang ziam cile Topa ii kumpi tu in a teal pa haamsiat hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahizong David in Abishai le a suapuipa Joab munah, “A kua in no ngaisutna hong ngen ziam? Ngim hong pia tu nu ziam? Tu in kei Israel ii kumpipa hi zo khi hi, tuaciang tu ni in Israel te kuama kithatlum ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciang Shimei munah, “Nang hong kithatlum ngawl tu hi ci in kamciam hong pia khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Saul ii tupa Mephibosheth sia David taw kisi tu in hong pai hi. Ama in kumpipa ii Jerusalem a nusiat hun pan ngalzo a hong cia kik dong, a peang le sil ngawl, a khamul le meet ngawl, a puan le sawp ngawlin omcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kumpipa taw kimu tu in Jerusalem ah Mephibosheth hong thet ciangin, kumpipa in, “Mephibosheth awng, nang kei taw hong paikhawm ngawl ni hi. Banghang ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in, “Kumpipa awng, na heaksa bangma, kei sia ka peang zaw hi. Ka naseampa munah ka laa a kungh hong thuasak ta'n, kumpipa taw tonkhawm nuam khi hi, ka ci hang ama in kei hong leeheak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in kei huvau Kumpipa nangma tungah leilot hi, ahihang nang sia Pathian ii vantunglalang taw na kibang hi, tua ahikom maan na sak bangin ngamta in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka pa ii innkuanpuite theampo kumpipa ii na thisak sia ahi tu ma hi, ahihang nangma in na sabuai ah an ka neak thei natu thu hong pia ni hi. Kumpipa tung pan hamphatna dang kong nget thuathua lai natu thu om ngawl hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Bangma son thua kul nawn bo. Nang le Ziba in Saul ii ngamh teng na hawm natu khensat zo khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Ziba in tang siat tahen. Kumpipa nangma ciidam in inn nong cia kik sia kei atu pha zo hi,” ci in Mephibosheth in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gilead pan Barzillai zongh kumpipa ii Jordan a kan ciang a cing tu in Rogelim pan hong paisuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Barzillai sia kum sawmliat a pha pasal huai mama khat ahi hi. Ama hau mama a, Mahanaim ah a taam sung kumpipa anvaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kumpipa in ama tungah, “Kei taw Jerusalem ah ih paikhawm tu a, nang kong en tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahihang Barzillai in, “Kei sia ngei nungta nawn ngawl tu khi hi, banghangin kumpipa taw Jerusalem ah pai tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kei kum sawmliat pha zo a, bangma in nopsak hong pia nawn ngawl hi. Ka neak ka dawnte ii limna le he nawn ngawl, lasa te ii aw le za thei nawn ngawl khi hi. Kumpipa nang atu vanh ngitpi khat suak bek tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuabang tel lian a saang tu in kiphu nawn ngawl khi hi. Tua ahikom Jordan ngal khat tawm khawng dong hong pai lai bek tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua zawkciang hong ciasak ta'n a, ka nute ka pate ii thaan hui ka inn ah thi ka tong. Hi munah ka tapa Chimham om hi, ama in nangma na hong sepsak tu hi; ama nangma paipui in, kumpipa awng, nangma ii pha na sakbel bangin ama atu vawtsak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Ama paipui tu khi hi, tuaciang vawt a na oai babangin ama tungah ka vawt tu hi. Tuaciang nong nget pawpo nang atu in hong vawtsak tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David le a mite theampo in Jordan ngun kan uh hi. Ama in Barzillai namh in, thupha pia a, tuaciang inn ah Barzillai cia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Judah mi theampo le Israel mi teng ii a lang in kumpipa cing in ngun a kan zawkciang, ama Gilgal ah paitan a. Chimham sia ama taw paikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuaciang Israel te a om theampo kumpipa kungah pai in, ama munah, “Kumpipa awng, koma suapui Judah mite in nang hong la khe a, nangma, na innkuanpuite le na mite ii Jordan na kan uh ciang hong cin natu banghangin thu nei kisa ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Judah mite in, “Banghangin tuabang ngamta khu ziam cile kumpipa sia koma mi khat hi. Tua ahikom banghangin hisia hu in thin uuk thei nu ziam? Ama in ka an neak tu uh la hong leisak bo, a dang zongh bangma piak hong nei ngawl hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel te in, “Ama sia noma mi khat hikale David kumpipa tungtaang ah no sangin koma in see sawm bang a tamzaw in thu nei khu hi. Banghangin hong no mu nu ziam? Kumpipa ciapui kik natu kam a nging phitsak sia koma khu hi, mangil heak vun,” ci in zo kik hi. Ahihang Judah mite ii a cite sia Israel mite kampauna sangin nasia zaw in khalh zaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gilgal ah Benjamin mi Bikri ii tapa Sheba a kici mihing mannung ngawl khat om hi. Ama in lemle tumin au a, “David taak hen! Ei ama zui ngawl tu hi hing! Israel pasalte awng inn ah cia tawng!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom Israel te in David nusia in Sheba zui ahihang Judah mite sia thumaan top in, Jordan pan Jerusalem ah David zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem khua a kumpi inn ah David a thet ciangin kumpi inn cing tu in ama nusiat zino sawm teng la in, a cingte ii khutnuai ah koi hi. Amate ii taangsapna babangin sik hi, ahihang amate taw nupa vai in omkhawm ngawl hi. A nuntak lai teng kikhumcip in meingong bangin nungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in Amasa munah, “Judah mite khawmtua in, thai ciangin amate taw hi lai ah hong heak kik tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amasa in amate khawmtua tu in pai hi, ahihang kumpipa hunciam lapin a theng kik bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom kumpipa in Abishai munah, “Absalom sangin Sheba in ngim hong pia zaw tu hi. Ka mite la in a, ama del in, tua ahibuale kulh taw a ki uum khua pawlkhat hong la tha tu a, ei kung pan suakta tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom Joab ii mite, kumpi cingte le ngalkap dang teng in Abishai taw Jerusalem nusia in Sheba del uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate suangpi khat sia omna Gibeon a thet uh ciang Amasa taw kisi uh hi. Joab sia ngalsim natu puansilh in, a namsau sia a paai taw a kawngkhau tungah khit hi. Ama mai sangah a pai laitak a namsau taaksua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab in Amasa munah, “Bang na ci ziam, ka lawmpa awng,” ci in, ama namh tu bangin a khut ziatsang taw a khamul len hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amasa sia Joab ii a khut langkhat ah a toai namsau sia pan kidal ngawl ahikom Joab in a ngil panin sun a, a ngilzang teng lei ah keekeak hi. Ama thakhatin thi paih a, Joab ii a sat kik kul ngawl hi. Tuaciang Joab le a suapui pa Abishai in Sheba del uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joab ii mi khat Amasa ii luang hui ah ding a, “Joab le David mi ahi theampo in Joab nung zui vun!” ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chi taw a kidim Amasa ii luang sia lampi laizang ah liik hi. Joab ii mihing pa in, a kuama theampo in tawlnga in a et thong uh bek a mu ciang, ama in a luang sia lampi pan lo sungah kai in, puanvan taw siin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A luang lampi pan a khiin zawkciang a kuama po in Joab zui in Sheba del uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sheba in Israel nam theampo ii ngam kaantan in, Abel Beth Maacah khuapi ah pai hi, tuaciang Bikri ii bee le phungte hong kikhawm a, khuapi sungah ama nung zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joab ii mite in Sheba sia tua munah a om hunlam za uh ahikom amate pai in khuapi uumci uh hi. Luphung puanung pangh panin lei vum tosak a, a luphung cip thei natu in a nuai pan zong lei to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua khuapi sungah nupi ciim khat om a, tua nu in luphung panin au a, “Na ngai vun! Na ngai vun! Joab hi sungah hong pai natu in na son vun; ama taw thu son nuam khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Joab pai a, tuaciang tua nu in, “Nang Joab na hi ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Ama in, “Hi hi, keima khi hi,” ci in zo hi. Tua nu in “Topa awng hong ngai ta'n,” ci hi. Ama in, “Hong ngai tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua nu in, “Nidang tawngh lai in, ‘Abel khuapi ah pai in a, hong zo kikna ngai in’ — kici a, tuabang ma in kingamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ko khuapi sia lian a, Israel ngam ah kilemna a om bel, a thumaanbel khuapi khat ahi hi. Banghangin tuasia suksiat tu hanciam ni ziam? Pathian ii neisa sia zaanciimsak nuam ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joab in, “Hi ngei ngawl tu khi hi! Na khuapi sia bangma hunin zaanciimsak, ahibuale hong suksiatsak ngeingawl tu khi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuabang sia ko ngealna hi ngawl hi. Ephraim mualtung ngam pan Bikri ii tapa Sheba a ci sia in Kumpipa David langpanin leedo hi. Hi sia pa hong aap lete, khuapi pan nungkin tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi. “Ama lutang sia luphung tung kan in no kungah kong lawn tu hi,” tua nu in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama tua khua mite kungah ama ii ngealna taw pai hi, amate in Sheba ii lu tan in, luphung kaantan in Joab kungah lawn uh hi. Ama in a mite khuapi a nusiat natu in lemle tum a, amate inn ah ciakik uh hi. Taciang Jerusalem kumpipa kungah Joab heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joab sia Israel ngalkaphonpi ukpa hi; Jehoiada ii tapa Benaiah sia David a cingte a ukpa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Adoniram in zawthawk thu taw kisawlin na a sepsakna teng uk a; Ahilud ii tapa Jehoshaphat in tepteena lai teng sai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sheva sia kumpi zum thuzeakpa ahi hi; Zadok le Abiathar te sia thiampi te ahi uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaciang Jair khua pan Ira zongh David ii thiampi khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David ii kumpi in a maan hunsungin kum thum sitset kialpi nasia khat tung hi. Tua hi a, David in Topa munah tuasia thu a dok ciang, Topa in, “Saul le a bangkua in mihing that mawna vawt hi; ama in Gibeon mite thatlum hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(Gibeon mite sia Israel mi hi ngawl a; amate sia, Israel te in hut tu dal tu in kamciam a piaksa Amor mi pawlkhat hi napi, Israel mite in Judah mite atu a deisak leilam manin Saul in tuate mot tu in hanciam hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom David in Gibeon mite samsak a, “No atu bang hong vawtsak thei tu khi ziam? Topa ii mite tungah thupha na piak natu in no tungah hong tatkhialna te hong lul kik nuam khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in, “Saul le a bangkua taw ka kihauna uh sia ngunn le khamh taw thu kisaatsat thei ngawl bek dom ngawlin Israel mite khat zongh thatlum nuam ngawl khu hi,” ci in zo hi. David in, “Tua ahile no atu in kei bang hong vawtsak tu ci in na ngaisun uh ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in, “Saul in ko sia hong maaimot nuam hi, tuaciang Israel ngamsung koima ah khat zongh a nungta in hong koi nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom Saul ii suan le paal pasal sali hong aap tavun, Topa ii kumpi tu a teal Saul ii khua Gibeah ah amate sia Topa mai ah ka awksak tu uh hi,” ci in zo uh hi. Kumpipa in, “Amate hong aap tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang Jonathan taw a thiangtho kamciamna a piak hu in, David in Saul ii tupa, Jonathan ii tapa, Mephibosheth khoaikhe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang ama in Aiah ii tanu Rizpah ii Saul taw a hin tapate nii, Armoni le Mephibosheth la hi; ama in Saul ii tanu Merab le Meholah pan Barzillai ii tapa Adriel taw a hin tapa nga teng zongh la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in amate teng Gibeon mite tungah aap a, tuate in Topa mai mual tungah awklumsak uh hi — tuaciang a sali ma in thi khawm uh hi. Tua a thi hun sia phalbi bo kuan hi a, mangtaang at a kipatsawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciangin Saul ii zino, Aiah tanu Rizpah sia mithiluangte kisialna suangpi tungah khau-ip buk vawtin anlaak kipat pan kipan tangngam ngua a zuk dong om hi. Ama in sun in mithiluangte a ne tu vacimte hung a, zanin ngamsate neak tu pan dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in Rizpah ii ngamtatna a zaak ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama pai a, Gilead ngam Jabesh mite kung panin Saul le a tapa Jonathan ii ngu la hi. (Amate in Gilboa mualvum tung a Saul a kithalup ni in Philistine te ii a luang a khaina Beth Shan taangpi khawlmun panin ngu uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in Saul le Jonathan ii ngute le a ki awklumsak pasal sali teng ii ngute zongh khawmtua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in kumpipa sawl babangin, Saul le Jonathan ii ngute Benjamin ngamsung Zela khua, Saul ii pa Kish ii thaan sungah phum uh hi. Tuasia zawkciang amate ngam atu a thungetna teng Pathian in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Philistine te le Israel te ngal kisimna khat om kik a, David le a mite pai in Philistine te do uh hi. Kido hun sung khat ah David toi zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thatang lian mama Ishbibenob a kici khat sia taau taw a kivawt kilogramme thum le lang a ngit teipi khat toai in, namsau thak khat kua a, David that thei tu in ki um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang Zeruiah ii tapa Abishai in David hu a, thatang lianpa simin thatlum hi. Tua zawkciang David ii mite in David peuma amate taw ngalsim khawm tu in a kuan kik nawn ngawl natu in kamciam piasak hi. Amate in, “Nang sia Israel te ii lam etna ni hi, nang hong taan nuam ngawl khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hisia zawkciang Gob ah Philistine te taw kidona khat om kik a, Hushah pan Sibbecai in Saph a kici thatang lian mama khat thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gob ma ah Philistine te taw kidona khat om a, Bethlehem pan Jair ii tapa Elhanan in Gath mi Goliath that hi, ama ii teibul sia thiamtakte ii thiambanna pumlawng cia pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciang Gath ah ngal kidona dang khat om a, tua munah thatang lian mama ngal sim uuk mama khat om hi. Ama in a khutte ah khutme luk veve le a peangte ah peangme luk veve nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in Israel te nalh hi, tuaciang David ii suapuipa Shammah ii tapa Jonathan in ama thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi mihing li teng sia Gath mi thatang lian te suan vive hi a, David le a mite in thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in David sia Saul le a ngal dangte kung panin a hutkhiat ciangin David in Topa tungah hi la a sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in kei hong dal pa hi; ama sia ka kulh kho ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka Pathian sia ka kidalna hi a, tuaciangin ama hangin kei ka ngammuang hi. Ama in lum bangin kei hong sung hi; ama in kei hong hung a, kei hong keamcing hi. Ama in ka ngumpa hi; Ama in a ngoltolte kung panin kei hong dalin hong hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa ka biakpui a, ama in ka ngalte kung panin hong hun hi. Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thina tuihualte ka kiim theampo ah om a; lalna tuihualte kei tungah hong kihual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thina ii lau huaina ka kiim ah hong om a, tuaciang thaankuul in kei thaang hong sia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngim ka nga ciangin Topa ka biakpui a; ka Pathian munah hu ka ngen hi. A biakinn sung pan ka aw hong za a; hu ngen in ka auna aw ama in hong ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciang leitung sia liingin ngawk a; van ii a bul a zungte kivei in liing hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian a thin uuk hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A naak hawng panin meikhu hong pusuak a, a kam sung pan a kaanghtumsak thei meikuang le meikam leang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in vantung balkeakin hong pai suk a, a peang nuai ah meeivom kaai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in cherub tha tungah to in manlang takin leang a; vui ii thakhui te tungah khualhaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama le ama khuazing taw kituam a; tui taw kidim meeikaai saate in ama kiim uum hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />khualeng in meikamte ama mai ah kuangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in van pan vanto nging bang hisak a, Vaanglianbelpa Pathian ii aw kiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in a thaltangte kap a, a ngalte kithethaangsak hi; khualeng kuang taw amate taisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in a ngalte a teih ciang le a thin uukin a hawksan ciangin, Tuipi ii tawdap kihawk a, leitung ii tawdap kilawt hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in tungsang panin hong baan suk a, kei hong len hi; ama in tuithukna panin kei hong kaito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thahat ka ngalte kung pan ahizong kei hong ensan theampo te kung pan ahizong hong suatak hi — kei atu in amate hat leih uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngim ka nga ciang, amate in kei hong sim a, ahizong Topa in kei hong dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in launa pan hong hu a; kei tungah hong lungkim hu in kei hong hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A maan bang ngamta ka hikom Topa in kei, tel hong pia hi; paubaang ngawl ka hikom ama in thupha hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa thukham ka ni a; ka Pathian kung pan ka puapial bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama ii thukham theampo ka tang a; a thupiakte ni ngawlin ka om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in ka maw ngawl hunlam hong he a, a maan ngawl ngamtatnate pan ka kikep hong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A maan bang ngamta ka hikom ama in tel hong pia hi, banghang ziam cile paubaang ngawl ka hi hong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa awng, nang tungah hong thumaante tungah na thumaan a, a cialcingte tungah na phatna kicing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangma in a thiangtho te ii tungah na thiangtho a, ahizong a seksolte na ngal vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A kiniamkhiakte na ngum a, ahizong a kiphasakte na kiniamkhiaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangma, Topa , ka khuavak na hi hi; ka khuazing na nilkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka ngalte ka sim natu in thahatna nong pia a, amate kihuuknate ka zaw zawk natu in vaangletna nong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi Pathian — bangza in ama nasepnate cialcing a, ama kammalte suan taak ziam! Ama hong dalna a zong theampo atu in ama in lum khat taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Topa bekma Pathian hi a; Pathian bekma ih kihuukna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hi Pathian in a kip a kho ka bukna hi; Ama in ka lampi ngammuangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in ka peangte sangai bangin kho takin hong khuasuansak a; mualte tungah kei hong keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in ngal kisim hong sinsak a, tuasia ciang thalkawng a khobel zongh ka zangh thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Oh, Topa, nangma in nong dal a, nong hun hi; nong huna in keima hong thupisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hong kimat natu panin nong keam a, bangma hunin ka puk ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka ngalte ka del a ka zo hi; amate ka mot mateng ka tawp bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amate ka vaat vawk a, a thoto zo bua uh hi; amate ka mai ah ngallel in puk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ngal do natu in thahatna nong pia a; ka ngalte nong zosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ka ngalte ka kung panin na taisak a; kei hong ensan te ka mon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate in huna zong ka le kuama in hun ngawl hi; amate in Topa biakpui hikale ama in zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Amate ka sucip a, leivui bang suak uh hi; lampi ah a om buan bangin amate ka tuanhcil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hong leedo ka mite kung pan nong hun a minamte ka ukna nong kipsak hi; tu in ka heak ngeingawl mihingte ka khutnuai mi suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ngamdangmite ka mai ah hong kun a; amate in ka kammal a zaak ciang hong ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amate a thin letna uh bosua in, a kulhte sung pan liing vadil in hong pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Topa nungta hi! Kei hong hunpa pok vun! Kei hong hun a thahat Pathian ii letna thangsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ama in ka ngalte hong zosak hi! minamte ka khutnuai ah ama in huthe ngam ngawlin koi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />ka ngalte kung pan kei hong hun hi. Oh Topa , ka ngalte nong zosak a, a ngoltol mite kung panin nong dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tua ahiciang minamte sungah nang kong pok a; na tungah pokna late kong sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Pathian in a kumpipa tungah zawna liante pia hi; ama in a tealsa khat ii tungah itna kip lak a, David le a suan a paalte tungah itna kip a tawntungin lak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesse ii tapa, David sia Pathian ii mi thupi tu in a vawt, Jacob te ii Pathian in kumpipa tu in a teal hi a, Israel atu in la hoite a phuakpa ahi hi. Hi teng sia David ii a khakbel a pau kammalte ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ii thaa in kei tungtawnin pau hi; ama ii thu puak sia ka muk tungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel ii Pathian pau zo hi; Israel a dal pa in kei tungah hong ci hi: “Thutang khenna taw a uk kumpipa, Pathian thu ni in a uk pa sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />meeikaai om ngawl zing khuavak tuung nitaang taw kibang hi, ngua theau zawkciang lopate a teesak vasip ni taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian ii ka suan ka paalte thupha a piak tu zia sia tuabang ahi hi, banghang ziam cile ama in kei taw tawntung thuciamna khat hong vawt hi, a kipaltan ngawl tu thukimna khat, a kikheal ngeingawl tu kamciam piakna khat ahi hi. Kei dei sia tua teng lian ahi hi; tua in ka zawna hi tu a, Pathian in taangtungsak nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian a selte sia, a kivawk lingte taw kibang hi; Kuama in khutnguak taw amate tham thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thik vanhzak ahibuale tei khat na zak kul tu a; amate kaanghtum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David ii a minthang ngalkapte sia hite ahi hi: a masa phitbel sia Tachemon pan Josheb Basshebeth hi a, ama sia “Thum teng” ii lampui pa ahi hi; ama in ngal kisimna khat sungah a teipi taw ngalte 800 do in thatlum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A minthang thum sung pan a niina sia Ahoh phung sung pan Dodo ii tapa Eleazar hi. Ni khat ni in ama le David in ngaldo tu a kikhawmtua Philistine te thato uh hi. Israel te nungkin a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahihang ama ding topin do in, a khut khikcip ahikom namsau tha thei nawn ngawl hi. Topa in tua ni in zawna lianpi nga hi. Ngal a zaw zawkciang Israel te Eleazar kungah heak kikin a thite ii ngaldalna teng suut uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A minthang thum sungah a thumna sia Harar pan Agee ii tapa Shammah hi. Philistine te sia be ciinna lo khat omna Lehi ah kikhawmtua uh hi. Israel te Philistine te mai panin tai keak uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ahizong Shammah ahile lo sungah a dinmun nusia ngawlin ngalnang a, Philistine te that hi. Topa in tua ni in zawna lianpi nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anlaak hun kipat nai ciang, “Sawmthumte” sung pan thum sia David omna Adullam suanghawng sungah pai in, Philistine te ahile Rephaim Kuam ah ngiaphual saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin David sia ngalnanna tu in a ki uum mualtung khat ah om a, Philistine te pawlkhat in Bethlehem khua la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in inn sang ngai mama in, “Bethlehem kongpi hui tuikhuk panin ka dawn tu tui, mi khat po in hong paipui le paw uuk na peu ing!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngalkap minthang thumte in a pai natu Philistine te phual nawkkeak in, tuikhuk pan tui tawm a laak zawkciang David kungah paipui uh hi. Ahihang David in a dawn nuam bua hi; tua sangin Topa tungah piakkhiatna in lei ah sung zaw a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuaciang, “ Topa awng, hi tui ka ne thei ngei buatu hi! A nuntakna a khaam mite ii chi a ne taw ka kibang tu hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom ama in tui a neak tu nial hi. Ngalkap minthang thumte ii ngalhan nasepnate tuabang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joab ii suapuipa Abishai (a nu sia Zeruiah hi) sia “A minthang Sawmthumte” ii lampui ahi hi. Ama in tei taw a ngalte zathum do a, that siat hi, tuabangin ama “Sawmthumte” sungah minthang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama sia “Sawmthumte” sungah a minthangbel hi a, amate ii lampui hong suak hi, ahihang tua “Thumte” za in minthang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kabzeel pan Jehoiada ii tapa Benaiah sia ngalkap minthang dang khat hi; ama in ngalhang nasep lian tam mama a seamsa hi a, tuasung pan Moab ngalhang kiciante nii a thalup kihel hi. Vuuk taak ni khat in, dum khat sungah ama tuaksuk in tawpi khat thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in a thatang lian mama Egypt te tei toai khat that hi. Benaiah in a molpum taw Egypt pa sim a, a tei sutin tua taw that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Sawmthumte” sungah khat ahi Benaiah ii ngalhan nasepnate tuabang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama sia “Sawmthumte” sung panin kician a, ahihang “Thum teng” za in minthang zo ngawl hi. David in ama a cingte ukpa in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Sawmthumte” sungah a kihel dang teng sia: Joab ii suapui Asahel, Bethlehem pan Dodo ii tapa Elhanan, Harod pan Shammah le Elika Pelet pan Helez Tekoa pan Ikkesh ii tapa Ira Anathoth pan Abiezer Hushah pan Mebunnai Ahoh pan Zalmon Netophah pan Maharai Netophah pan Baanah ii tapa Heleb Benjamin ngam Gibeah pan Ribai ii tapa Ittai Pirathon pan Benaiah Gaash ngamnai kuamte sung pan Hiddai Arabah pan Abialbon Bahurim pan Azmaveth Shaalbon pan Eliahba Jashen ii tapate Jonathan Harar pan Shammah Harar pan Sharar ii tapa Ahiam Maacah pan Ahasbai ii tapa Eliphelet Gilo pan Ahithophel ii tapa Eliam Carmel pan Hezro Arab pan Paarai Zobah pan Nathan ii tapa Igal Gad pan Bani Ammon pan Zelek Beeroth pan Naharai Joab ii ngaldalna puapa Jattir pan Ira le Gareb Hit mi Uriah, ahi uh hi. A vekpi in ngalkap minthang sawmthum le sali pha hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa sia Israel te ii tungah khatvei ma thin uuk kik a, amate tungah David in ngim piasak hi. Topa in ama mun ah, “Va pai ta'n a, Israel te le Judah te mi phaza sim ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom David in ngalkaphonpi ukpa Joab munah thupia hi: “Na uliante taw Israel nam theampo sung, ngam mong khat pan mong khat dong paitan a, mi phaza sim tavun. Bangza pha ziam he nuam khi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang Joab in kumpipa munah, “Kumpipa awng, Topa na Pathian in Israel mite, tu a zaa sangin a zaa zakhat a tamzaw in hong pungsak tahen a, tuaciang tuabang a punsakna sia a mu tu in nangma hong nungtasak tahen. Ahihang, kumpipa awng banghang hisia vawt nuam ni ziam?” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang kumpipa in Joab le a uliante in a thu nisak a; amate in kumpipa omna nusia a, Israel mite a phakza sim tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in Jordan ngun kaantan a, Gad ngamkuam laizang a Aroer khuapi ii thang sangah ngiaphual saat uh hi. Tua mun panin amate in saksang Jazer ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua mun pan Hit te ngamsung Gilead le Kadesh ah pai uh hi. Tua zawkciang amate in Dan ah pai in, Dan pan nitumna sangah Sidon zuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua mun pan amate thangsang zuan a, kulh taw a ki uum Tyre khuapi, Hiv le Canaan te khuapi theampo, a khakbel in Judah ngam thangsang Beersheba ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuabangin amate ngamsung buppi ah khualhaw uh a, tha kua le ni kul zawkciang Jerusalem ah heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in kumpipa tungah, ngalkap seam thei pasal sia: Israel ngam ah 800,000 om in, Judah ngam ah 500,000 om hi, ci in son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang David in mi simna sazian a laaksak zawkciang ama kithasungin a thin hong ngim a, Topa munah, “Hi nasep ka sep sia maw mama khi hi! Nong hesuakna in hong maisak ta'n. Mawmawt nasep a seam hi thong khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in David ii kamsaang Gad munah, “David kungah pai in son ta'n, ama ii teal tu thu nam thum pia khi hi. Ama teal po vawt tu khi hi,” ci hi. A zing ciang zingsang, David ii thaw zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ama kungah Gad pai a, Topa ii sawl teng son hi, tuaciang ama in, “Koisia teal tu ni ziam? Na ngam sungah kum thum kialpi tungsak tu ni ziam, ahibuale na ngalte mai pan tha thum sung tai zaw tu ni ziam, tua ahibuale ni thum sung na ngam sungah natsia tungsak nuam zaw ni ziam? Tu in ngaisun ta'n a, Topa munah ka puak kik tu na zona hong son ta'n,” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David in, “A heehuai mama dinmun ah om khi hi! Ahihang mihingte ii daan hong piak tu uuk ngawl khi hi. Topa khat bek ma ko daan hong pia tu pa hi hen, banghang ziam cile ama sia ngual hesuakna thin nei hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua ni zing pan kipan ama ii tealna hun a cin dong Topa in Israel tungah natsia tungsak hi. Ngam mong khat pan mong khat dong Israel mi tul sawmsali thi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa ii vantunglalang in Jerusalem lalcipsak tu in a kipat ciangin Topa in mihingte daan a piak huvau a thin kheal kik a, amate a that vantunglalang munah, “Tawp in! Pha zo!” ci hi. Vantunglalang sia Jebus mi Araunah ii ancilna nai theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in mite a that vantunglalang sia mu a, Topa munah, “A maw sia keima khi hi, a seam khialpa sia keima khi hi. Hi a khuangai huai mihingte in bang seam thong na ziam? Keima le ko innkuan daan nong piak tu hi zaw khu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ni ma in Gad sia David kungah hong pai a, “Araunah ii ancilna munah va pai ta'n a, tua munah biaknatau khat Topa atu sa ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David in Topa ii thupiak ni in Gad ii sawl bangin pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Araunah in a etsuk le kumpipa le a uliante ama kungah hong paito mu hi. Ama in David ii mai lei ah kisepsuk in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Kumpipa awng, banghangin hi sungah hong om ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. David in, “Na ancilna mun a lei tu le, natsiatna a thai natu in. Topa atu biaknatau khat sa tu hong pai khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tuasia la in, kumpipa awng, tuaciang Topa tungah na uuk babangin biakpiakna pia in. Hi sung biaknatau tungah na biakpiak natu in khuital te om hi, tuaciang hi munah khuite ii kanhakte le ancilna thingpheakte om hi, mei thu natu in zangh in,” Araunah in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Araunah in kumpipa tungah a vekpi in pia siat hi, tuaciang ama munah, “ Topa na Pathian in na biakpiakna hong saang tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang kumpipa in zo a, “Hi ngawl hi. Tuate ii man hong pia tu khi hi. Topa ka Pathian tungah keima ii man piak ngawlin ka nga sangaw biakpiaknate pia ngawl tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi. Ama in ancilna mun le khuitalte ngunntang 50 taw lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in Topa tungah biaknatau sa in, meihal biakpiakna le kipawlkhop biakpiakna pia hi. Topa in a thungetna saang a, Israel ngam sungah tua natna kamh hi.
  </para>
</usx>
